"ready", "node_role": "timeline", "revision": 1, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:07.000Z", "id": "F14D87F8-9675-4E18-A7AC-3B06680E7721"}], "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:07.814Z", "role": "user", "tombstone": false, "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "552C472C-33B3-43EF-8D10-27EDE1E4044A"}]}
