INFO 2026-05-21 02:11:21,803 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=47113F72-9DA1-44E3-BF82-EEBC48435266] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MzMwMjA5LCJpYXQiOjE3NzkzMjg0MDksImp0aSI6IjEwNDhmYTU0ZmVlNzRmNDZhNDdkN2NhZmQwZTk0YjQ4IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjQifQ.4cgV7oNt-BaLsvuAuOMJRYoL78vWfOZnO3kEBgjDJec", "X-Request-Id": "47113F72-9DA1-44E3-BF82-EEBC48435266", "Content-Length": "1945"} body={"messages": [{"thread_top_p": 1, "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "role": "assistant", "thread_id": "DFE1CA7F-B9EF-4934-8797-A0313BA2351C", "blocks": [{"updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.000Z", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_00_eGInMtSU96QJn0uTS7bd6895", "status": "ready", "order_key": 2000, "revision": 1779329480962885, "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.000Z", "id": "9307D78A-1AF0-5CAB-96D5-117CBDCF5BA9", "kind": "tool", "node_role": "tool"}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.000Z", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "处方卡片已生成。该门诊处方包含以下要点：\n\n- **诊断**：结膜炎\n- **药品1**：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）5ml:5mg，每日4次，每次1滴\n- **药品2**：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）6ml:3mg(0.05%)，每日2次，每次1滴；注意开封后4周内用完"}}, "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.000Z", "status": "ready", "order_key": 3000, "revision": 1779329480961812, "id": "FF88EEB2-34D5-5145-8C76-615607E422F2", "kind": "text", "node_role": "timeline"}], "delivery_state": "pending", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:07.861Z", "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "client_message_id": "6BC20D00-D5A1-4505-AD40-F034C944268D", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.963Z", "thread_max_messages": 20, "tombstone": false}]}
