出任何多余文字内容 \n直接调用 generate_structured_health_card 带入合适的参数  其他都不要输出"}}, "status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:53.000Z", "node_role": "timeline", "id": "F8C36BEA-BE6A-4057-A6B1-928613F6E555", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:53.000Z"}], "client_message_id": "843E9EFE-FCDE-4792-86E8-93553E411224", "model_name": "user", "role": "user", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:53.537Z", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "delivery_state": "pending"}]}
