INFO 2026-05-21 02:18:25,608 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=417FA524-C7FB-43BF-8559-E61D9DE413BE] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MzMwMjA5LCJpYXQiOjE3NzkzMjg0MDksImp0aSI6IjEwNDhmYTU0ZmVlNzRmNDZhNDdkN2NhZmQwZTk0YjQ4IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjQifQ.4cgV7oNt-BaLsvuAuOMJRYoL78vWfOZnO3kEBgjDJec", "X-Request-Id": "417FA524-C7FB-43BF-8559-E61D9DE413BE", "Content-Length": "1930"} body={"messages": [{"thread_max_messages": 20, "tombstone": false, "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_id": "4C4FF6CD-AF9D-419D-B85D-C2211FF167B5", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:18:11.382Z", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:18:24.812Z", "blocks": [{"revision": 1779329904811817, "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。"}}}, "kind": "tool", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:18:24.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_r7Uzvof1kmxEgH33zErz6873", "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:18:24.000Z", "status": "ready", "id": "0D547C68-E962-5903-9F35-CA1AA18B8871"}, {"revision": 1779329904810662, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成处方卡片，包含以下信息：\n\n- **诊断**：结膜炎\n- **药品1**：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）5ml:5mg，每日4次，每次1滴\n- **药品2**：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）6ml:3mg(0.05%)，每日2次，每次1滴，开启后4周内用完"}}, "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:18:24.000Z", "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:18:24.000Z", "status": "ready", "id": "B7AA511A-05BD-5B5D-8BE6-F92125F483DE"}], "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "6040AE8D-977E-4F2F-8961-2EB15C69AD2F", "role": "assistant", "delivery_state": "pending", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro"}]}
