-913E502E7225", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/CBC070C6-6F32-4B31-9BF7-BF7D00F1C27A/IMG_1991.jpeg"}]}}}, {"revision": 1, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:29.000Z", "status": "ready", "kind": "text", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:29.000Z", "node_role": "timeline", "id": "7D805D81-80CE-4507-B57B-C01920A5A6AE", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "不要输出任何多余文字内容 \n直接调用 generate_structured_health_card 带入合适的参数  其他都不要输出\n只生成处方"}}}]}]}
