* | 27岁 |\n| **门诊号** | 0000349056 |\n| **医院** | 苏州大学附属第四医院 |\n| **科室** | 皮肤科门诊 |\n| **诊断** | 结膜炎 |\n| **日期** | 2026年4月20日 |\n\n---\n\n## 药品明细\n\n### 1. 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\n- **规格**：5ml:5mg\n- **用法**：滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n\n### 2. 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\n- **规格**：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\n- **用法**：滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n- **⚠️ 提示**：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周"}]}}, "id": "A63A4418-4574-52C9-93FD-5E347323BF2F", "tool_call_id": "call_00_MwQvh1qYSrs3dW7dY2vk4877", "node_role": "toolPresentation", "kind": "knowledgeCards", "revision": 1779330590784875, "order_key": 2100, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:50.000Z"}, {"status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "create_knowledge_document", "content": "已生成知识库文档草稿「赵道凯-结膜炎处方-2026.04.20」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。"}}}, "id": "0E90DDDA-5199-5FBA-B80C-BFC340496A42", "tool_call_id": "call_00_MwQvh1qYSrs3dW7dY2vk4877", "node_role": "tool", "kind": "tool", "revision": 1779330592790483, "order_key": 4000, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z"}, {"status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成处方结构化卡片及知识文档草稿，可点击保存。"}}, "id": "2193B327-00CB-5E7F-8CC4-D7CE4BE8D564", "revision": 1779330592763359, "kind": "text", "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z"}], "thread_max_messages": 20, "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:29.690Z"}]}
