周\n\n---\n\n## 用药提醒\n\n- 普拉洛芬为**非甾体抗炎药**，用于缓解眼部炎症；盐酸氮卓斯汀为**抗组胺药**，用于缓解过敏症状\n- 两种滴眼液如需同时使用，建议间隔**5-10分钟**\n- 滴眼前洗净双手，瓶口勿接触眼睛或皮肤\n- 盐酸氮卓斯汀开封后**4周内**用完，过期丢弃", "id": "3DEC4CB0-2D94-AB92-11AD-CD6F669120E8", "shows_save_and_copy": true}]}}, "kind": "knowledgeCards", "node_role": "toolPresentation", "tool_call_id": "call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:43.000Z"}, {"revision": 1779331007516693, "order_key": 4000, "id": "D242E369-EB8B-5074-8FD6-4DA3A5B3D398", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "create_knowledge_document", "content": "已生成知识库文档草稿「处方：普拉洛芬滴眼液+盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（结膜炎）」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。"}}}, "kind": "tool", "node_role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z"}, {"id": "7F722253-CBA4-5DA4-A25F-AF03DAE60041", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成处方知识卡，包含两种滴眼液的用法用量和关键提醒。您可以点击卡片保存到知识库，方便随时查阅。"}}, "order_key": 5000, "node_role": "timeline", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "revision": 1779331007486284, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z"}], "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "role": "assistant", "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.517Z", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "4FE4A299-FA58-471B-892E-4DF8EAE1FEA8", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_id": "8943CE62-4DEF-4BD2-B622-BCC1CE3B6300", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:35:53.314Z"}]}
