: "2026-05-21T04:20:00.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:20:00.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_01_2AsiGnjTV9H0yh3D4mq71989"}, "client_message_id": "69D9A27F-936F-4728-9246-960BBED6ACF6", "thread_id": "D11482BF-11F8-47D0-BCB9-7234D0DD76F4"}, {"block": {"node_role": "timeline", "id": "6416CEBB-16B9-5015-82E3-7A87FFC54AE2", "kind": "text", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成两张健康卡片：门诊处方单（结膜炎用药）和胃镜诊断报告单（慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流）。"}}, "revision": 1779337363346455, "status": "ready", "order_key": 5000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z"}, "client_message_id": "D977EE7E-B3BF-416E-8AAC-1EC3845823F2", "thread_id": "7F897596-1A87-4CB5-8D63-16EC9CF5050F"}, {"block": {"node_role": "tool", "id": "3F51A015-6938-59B4-97F1-FA5640CBC9EC", "kind": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779337363348065, "status": "ready", "order_key": 2000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_bpquSByHlL8yZRvKGxbs4054"}, "client_message_id": "D977EE7E-B3BF-416E-8AAC-1EC3845823F2", "thread_id": "7F897596-1A87-4CB5-8D63-16EC9CF5050F"}, {"block": {"node_role": "tool", "id": "F1AD2014-C33D-5D7A-A86A-02D2B2FDDA3E", "kind": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779337363374504, "status": "ready", "order_key": 4000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:22:43.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_01_9G38kjBbwI7XUMyfI4JM6567"}, "client_message_id": "D977EE7E-B3BF-416E-8AAC-1EC3845823F2", "thread_id": "7F897596-1A87-4CB5-8D63-16EC9CF5050F"}, {"block": {"node_role": "timeline", "id": "575BF5F4-2950-5590-8B60-8CC49DA2DC6D", "kind": "text", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "看起来你遇到的是系统日志，显示 AI 对话请求失败了。让我帮你分析一下：\n\n## 问题分析\n\n从日志来看，关键错误是：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **错误码** | `40402` - `message_not_found` |\n| **失败原因** | 上送对话时找不到对应的消息 |\n| **最终表现** | AI 返回空文本 → 显示「⚠️ 生成内容为空，请重新尝试！」 |\n| **模型** | `deepseek-v4-pro` |\n| **总耗时** | 约 10 秒 |\n\n## 可能的原因\n\n1. **客户端消息 ID 不匹配**：`client_message_id: 69d9a27f-936f-4728-9246-960bbed6acf6` 在服务端找不到对应记录\n2. **会话状态异常**：可能是会话过期、断连后恢复时状态不一致\n3. **消息同步失败**：`outbox 自动上送失败` 说明离线消息队列重试也失败了\n\n## 建议操作\n\n- **刷新页面重试**：清除当前会话状态，重新发起对话\n- **检查网络稳定性**：不稳定的网络可能导致消息同步中断\n- **如果持续出现**：可能是服务端问题，建议稍等片刻再试，或联系平台技术支持\n\n---\n\n另外，我注意到你还没有上传任何健康档案。如果你有体检报告、处方单或病历等需要我帮你整理分析，可以随时上传，我能帮你生成结构化的健康卡片 📋"}}, "revision": 1779337621289308, "status": "ready", "order_key": 1000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:01.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:01.000Z"}, "client_message_id": "58EAA694-B499-4516-91C6-B83EE81C5273", "thread_id": "AC2E6A08-A3DC-40E1-AD3C-2CF622B9227F"}]}
