是服务端问题，建议稍等片刻再试，或联系平台技术支持\n\n---\n\n另外，我注意到你还没有上传任何健康档案。如果你有体检报告、处方单或病历等需要我帮你整理分析，可以随时上传，我能帮你生成结构化的健康卡片 📋"}}, "id": "575BF5F4-2950-5590-8B60-8CC49DA2DC6D", "revision": 1779337621289308, "kind": "text", "node_role": "timeline", "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:01.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:01.000Z", "order_key": 1000}, "thread_id": "AC2E6A08-A3DC-40E1-AD3C-2CF622B9227F", "client_message_id": "58EAA694-B499-4516-91C6-B83EE81C5273"}, {"block": {"status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已完成胃镜报告和病历卡片的生成。"}}, "id": "0AF6F4FE-DED2-5CB0-BB07-C850E12BA04D", "revision": 1779337645773475, "kind": "text", "node_role": "timeline", "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z", "order_key": 5000}, "thread_id": "65DB6FFC-C858-4F35-BD3D-351265B4EC3B", "client_message_id": "657A20D0-AC33-4924-8474-1F577AD8DBFB"}, {"block": {"status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "id": "E6D3171D-DAD4-51CB-9995-929CF1583051", "node_role": "tool", "kind": "tool", "revision": 1779337645774387, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_l1XG057hJbgVjFN5kLUW6572", "order_key": 2000}, "thread_id": "65DB6FFC-C858-4F35-BD3D-351265B4EC3B", "client_message_id": "657A20D0-AC33-4924-8474-1F577AD8DBFB"}, {"block": {"status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "id": "87E4B4B1-5E36-52A1-9EB3-51270890EF37", "node_role": "tool", "kind": "tool", "revision": 1779337645775266, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:27:25.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_hKPSIWgYLFtPpk4zv27R6115", "order_key": 4000}, "thread_id": "65DB6FFC-C858-4F35-BD3D-351265B4EC3B", "client_message_id": "657A20D0-AC33-4924-8474-1F577AD8DBFB"}]}
