INFO 2026-05-21 05:13:19,831 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=ED971CEE-C66B-4A4D-97C4-73DB1714E08A] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MzQwOTAwLCJpYXQiOjE3NzkzMzkxMDAsImp0aSI6IjM5MjI5MmExNTA4MjRkMmViNmQ3ZDBkYTJlNjMzNmFlIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjQifQ.1LGwusrqKvyh5ztbtIoO5jJD3WQ_6vwGbmRwiPIWfa4", "X-Request-Id": "ED971CEE-C66B-4A4D-97C4-73DB1714E08A", "Content-Length": "2904"} body={"messages": [{"delivery_state": "sending", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:08.561Z", "thread_id": "A6005715-4FCC-4665-99CA-962B04DCE452", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "thread_top_p": 1, "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "44AECA6E-773E-40BE-8F3D-91BE19F68286", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.815Z", "tombstone": false, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "role": "assistant", "blocks": [{"node_role": "timeline", "revision": 1779340398802039, "kind": "text", "order_key": 1000, "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "看起来你遇到了一个技术问题——`ageBlock payload 解码失败`，这通常出现在某些健康/医疗类应用或 SDK 的数据解析过程中。\n\n为了更准确地帮你排查，我需要了解更多信息：\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 请提供以下细节：\n\n1. **出现的场景**：\n   - 是在哪个 App / 平台 / SDK 中遇到的？（例如：某健康管理 App、微信小程序、Web 端等）\n   - 是在上传报告、查看健康数据、还是其他操作时出现的？\n\n2. **错误完整信息**：\n   - 能否提供完整的报错日志或截图？\n   - 是否有其他伴随的错误码或提示？\n\n3. **操作步骤**：\n   - 你当时在进行什么操作？（如扫码、上传体检报告、同步数据等）\n   - 是偶发还是每次必现？\n\n4. **环境信息**：\n   - 设备型号、系统版本\n   - App 版本号\n\n---\n\n### 🛠 常见可能原因（供参考）：\n\n| 可能原因 | 说明 |\n|---------|------|\n| **数据格式不匹配** | payload 编码方式与解码预期不一致（Base64 / Protobuf / JSON 等） |\n| **版本不兼容** | 客户端版本过旧，无法解析新版数据结构 |\n| **数据损坏** | 传输过程中 payload 被截断或损坏 |\n| **加密/签名问题** | ageBlock 需要"}}, "id": "8FC9DE45-7DC5-51C0-AE64-EC7B7895CE49", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.802Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.802Z"}], "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_max_messages": 20}, {"delivery_state": "sending", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.775Z", "thread_id": "ED0DCBC2-CB97-4006-AE5B-D3C6D8D70DD4", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "thread_top_p": 1, "model_name": "system", "client_message_id": "07570833-D5A6-4353-9778-8930A16E1133", "tombstone": false, "role": "system", "blocks": [{"node_role": "timeline", "revision": 1, "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "🛑 响应已打断"}}, "id": "935F0AA2-6016-4C32-8818-2531A39C3A24", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.775Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.775Z"}], "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_max_messages": 20}]}
