慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流。\",\"date\":\"2026-02-10\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"内镜检查\",\"diagnosis\":\"慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\",\"result_value\":\"食管通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门圆，开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常\",\"sort_order\":null,\"sub_category\":\"无痛电子胃镜\"}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\",\"title\":\"胃镜诊断报告单\"}", "title": "胃镜诊断报告单", "is_saved": false, "date_text": "2026-02-10", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）", "id": "2C8D86D5-E69B-4CA3-AF4A-D1401E267B05"}], "medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": [], "medications": []}}}, "revision": 1779340992714806, "tool_call_id": "call_00_wbMqHNvyjdhY5yJBvj3e5720", "status": "ready", "order_key": 2100, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:12.715Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:12.715Z", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_wbMqHNvyjdhY5yJBvj3e5720", "anchor": {"value": "call_00_wbMqHNvyjdhY5yJBvj3e5720", "type": "toolCall"}, "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "parent_block_id": "C83FC4E0-709A-58F2-B308-33ABA04D5966", "id": "4FA08902-1E35-5ED2-92B6-1BA6810234BB"}, {"node_role": "toolPresentation", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medical_cases": [], "exam_reports": [], "prescriptions": [{"oss_file_id": 531, "id": "60595E32-535D-40AE-BEF2-B42F142A5FCC", "is_saved": false, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\",\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼，提示开启瓶封后使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\",\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"}", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "subtitle": "结膜炎"}], "medications": []}}}, "revision": 1779341014014381, "tool_call_id": "call_00_wpDpRdsYnJRyNLiO1kyK3975", "status": "ready", "order_key": 2100, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:34.014Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:34.014Z", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_wpDpRdsYnJRyNLiO1kyK3975", "anchor": {"value": "call_00_wpDpRdsYnJRyNLiO1kyK3975", "type": "toolCall"}, "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "parent_block_id": "FE7E307B-AE3F-5C0D-8050-27DB6FDC5A8F", "id": "EB9223F1-C20A-5C7B-A065-5369095133BC"}, {"kind": "text", "id": "99CCA7B8-93EE-5222-990E-7FBB6870BC7B", "node_role": "timeline", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## 第二份：生化检验报告（血脂+肝肾功能等）"}}, "order_key": 3000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z", "status": "ready", "revision": 1779341016283132}, {"id": "101837BD-BF06-5DF2-91AE-0082FFF52122", "kind": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_00_DaAwBix8QA32YocZkYD32565", "node_role": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "order_key": 4000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.232Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.378Z", "status": "ready", "revision": 1779341016377675}, {"id": "99CCA6B8-93EE-506F-990E-7EBB6870BAC8", "kind": "text", "node_role": "timeline", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## 第三份：门诊用药单（结膜炎）"}}, "order_key": 5000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z", "status": "ready", "revision": 1779341016284610}, {"revision": 1779341016447603, "status": "ready", "kind": "tool", "order_key": 6000, "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_00_wpDpRdsYnJRyNLiO1kyK3975", "id": "FE7E307B-AE3F-5C0D-8050-27DB6FDC5A8F", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.232Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.448Z", "node_role": "tool"}, {"revision": 1779341016316152, "status": "ready", "kind": "text", "order_key": 7000, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## ✅ 三份报告已生成健康卡片，汇总如下：\n\n| 序号 | 卡片类型 | 来源 | 日期 | 核心内容 |\n|------|----------|------|------|----------|\n| 1 | **检查报告** | 胃镜诊断报告 | 2026-02-10 | 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流 |\n| 2 | **检查报告** | 生化检验（血脂+肝肾） | 2025-12-28 | 肝肾功能、血糖、心肌酶均正常；**LDL-C 3.51 mmol/L 边缘升高**，需关注 |\n| 3 | **用药处方** | 皮肤科/结膜炎 | 2026-04-20 | 普拉洛芬滴眼液 qid + 氮卓斯汀滴眼液 bid |\n\n---\n\n### 🔔 特别提醒：\n\n- **低密度脂蛋白（LDL-C）3.51 mmol/L** 已超出理想范围（<2.60），属于边缘升高。虽然总胆固醇尚在适宜范围，但建议结合心血管风险因素（如家族史、血压、体重等）咨询心内科或内分泌科，评估是否需要生活方式干预或药物治疗。\n- **慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流** 需注意饮食规律、避免暴饮暴食、少食辛辣油腻，必要时消化内科随访。\n- 结膜炎用药注意：氮卓斯汀滴眼液开封后 **4周内用完**，超期不可再用。"}}, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z", "id": "99CCA5B8-93EE-5EBC-990E-7DBB6870B915", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.233Z", "node_role": "timeline"}], "delivery_state": "sending", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:23:36.450Z", "role": "assistant", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "C2C71F0E-4EB2-495E-AD6A-6EEE15282BFE", "tombstone": false, "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_max_messages": 20}]}
