 "call_00_pbKqRcpWbPPVGITNZZQx8192", "type": "toolCall"}, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"exam_reports": [{"draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"pathology\",\"content\":\"内镜所见：食管通过顺利黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间以红为主；幽门圆开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常。诊断：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流。\",\"date\":\"2026-02-10\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"内镜检查\",\"diagnosis\":\"慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\",\"result_value\":\"食管通过顺利黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间以红为主；幽门圆开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常\",\"sort_order\":null,\"sub_category\":\"无痛电子胃镜\"}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\",\"title\":\"胃镜诊断报告单\"}", "oss_file_id": 532, "title": "胃镜诊断报告单", "date_text": "2026-02-10", "is_saved": false, "id": "502A1D2D-D73F-4264-91A2-D8B752DEA46F", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）"}], "medical_cases": [], "medications": [], "prescriptions": []}}}, "parent_block_id": "37F2A864-C11B-51B5-ABD6-BC2583E6FEDF", "tool_call_id": "call_00_pbKqRcpWbPPVGITNZZQx8192"}, {"anchor": {"value": "call_01_DzgIUC4N3DNXEp9QNA7X4913", "type": "toolCall"}, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "parent_block_id": "1B1CD6F8-2915-5C6C-AFC2-0AA0EB6FEE0C", "tool_call_id": "call_01_DzgIUC4N3DNXEp9QNA7X4913", "order_key": 2100, "id": "191D4EE1-EEC2-5DC4-93FE-F8DCA86F8181", "status": "ready", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "revision": 1779341168429171, "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"exam_reports": [], "medications": [], "prescriptions": [{"title": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "subtitle": "结膜炎", "is_saved": false, "id": "150FB08F-F395-4B53-ACAC-CED6DEF67931", "oss_file_id": 534, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"16:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼。开启瓶封后使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\",\"total_quantity\":null}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"赵道凯\",\"prescription_no\":\"0000349056\"}"}], "medical_cases": []}}}, "parent_tool_call_id": "call_01_DzgIUC4N3DNXEp9QNA7X4913", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:08.429Z", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:08.429Z"}, {"tool_call_id": "call_01_DzgIUC4N3DNXEp9QNA7X4913", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:08.671Z", "kind": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779341168671232, "order_key": 4000, "node_role": "tool", "id": "1B1CD6F8-2915-5C6C-AFC2-0AA0EB6FEE0C", "status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:08.599Z"}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:08.600Z", "kind": "text", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为你生成两份健康卡片：\n\n---\n\n### 📋 卡片一：胃镜检查报告\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **医院** | 苏州大学附属第四医院（独墅湖医院） |\n| **检查日期** | 2026年2月10日 |\n| **检查项目** | 无痛电子胃镜 |\n| **诊断** | **慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流** |\n| **关键发现** | 胃体见胆汁残留；胃窦黏膜红白相间以红为主；食管、贲门、胃底、胃角、幽门、十二指肠均未见明显异常 |\n\n---\n\n### 📋 卡片二：门诊用药单\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **医院** | 苏州大学附属第四医院 |\n| **科室** | 皮肤科门诊 |\n| **日期** | 2026年4月20日 |\n| **诊断** | 结膜炎 |\n\n| 药品 | 用法 |\n|------|------|\n| **普拉洛芬滴眼液**（普南扑灵）5ml:5mg | 滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴 |\n| **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液**（爱赛平）0.05% | 滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴 ⚠️ 开瓶后4周内用完 |\n\n---\n\n> ⚠️ **健康提示**：胃镜提示慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流，建议饮食规律、避免暴饮暴食、少食油腻刺激性食物，必要时消化内科随访。眼部用药请遵医嘱，两种滴眼液之间建议间隔5-10分钟。如有不适请及时就医。"}}, "revision": 1779341168601565, "order_key": 5000, "node_role": "timeline", "id": "95EF7631-194F-5D5C-B4EC-6A13757FE351", "status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:08.600Z"}], "tombstone": false, "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_top_p": 1, "role": "assistant", "client_message_id": "61F126FE-C65C-49F0-B6EB-BDF0F88B120C", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_max_messages": 20, "delivery_state": "sending", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:25:40.893Z"}]}
