"structuredHealthCards", "revision": 1779341238792986, "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medical_cases": [], "exam_reports": [{"id": "A966B4DC-2FB6-4DB4-806F-314EF4C98901", "date_text": "2026-02-10", "title": "无痛电子胃镜报告", "oss_file_id": 536, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"imaging\",\"content\":\"内镜所见：食管通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门圆，开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常。诊断：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流。\",\"date\":\"2026-02-10\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"body_part\":\"上消化道\",\"category\":\"影像学检查\",\"diagnosis\":\"慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\",\"result_value\":\"食管通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门圆，开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常\",\"sort_order\":null,\"sub_category\":\"无痛电子胃镜\"}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"title\":\"无痛电子胃镜报告\"}", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": false}], "prescriptions": [], "medications": []}}}, "parent_tool_call_id": "call_01_WmbJOGfMcwib8dekITcQ2137", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:18.793Z", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:18.793Z"}, {"anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_y3F8eLltfe7EIoP5mL9V2984"}, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "parent_block_id": "7192930B-499F-5F72-9357-1745B7BEE676", "tool_call_id": "call_00_y3F8eLltfe7EIoP5mL9V2984", "order_key": 2100, "id": "FCEFEDDB-EBFA-5E52-BB79-934CEB8311CB", "status": "ready", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "revision": 1779341244830692, "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": [{"is_saved": false, "oss_file_id": 537, "id": "42724CF1-3083-4EA2-BE1B-E515133DAE5D", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "subtitle": "结膜炎", "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"extra\":{},\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"每次1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_box\":{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"sort_order\":null,\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":null},\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"每次1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼。提示：开启瓶封后使用不可超过四周。\",\"medicine_box\":{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\",\"sort_order\":null,\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg（0.05%）\",\"total_quantity\":null},\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\",\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg（0.05%）\",\"total_quantity\":null}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"\",\"prescription_no\":\"\",\"status\":\"\"}"}], "exam_reports": [], "medications": []}}}, "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_y3F8eLltfe7EIoP5mL9V2984", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:24.831Z", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:24.831Z"}, {"anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_02_QiIPX79cdYynS5tImEZi6657"}, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "parent_block_id": "6670B124-0E21-53AC-B199-9B1ECFF27E9C", "tool_call_id": "call_02_QiIPX79cdYynS5tImEZi6657", "order_key": 2100, "id": "A3666726-1BB9-5D84-B9F6-E71A7F592AD1", "status": "ready", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "revision": 1779341245239339, "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [{"hospital": "苏州工业园区星塘医院", "date_text": "2025-06-04", "title": "颈椎椎间盘平扫、头颅平扫（CT）", "is_saved": false, "oss_file_id": 535, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"imaging\",\"content\":\"检查部位：颈椎椎间盘平扫、头颅平扫（CT）。检查所见：头颅CT平扫脑实质未见明显异常密度影，各脑室形态大小正常，脑沟裂池未见异常，中线结构居中，小脑及脑干未见异常。鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚。颈椎序列整齐，生理曲度平直，椎体缘骨质增生，C4\\/5、C5\\/6椎间盘稍向后突出，相邻硬膜囊稍受压，骨性椎管无明显狭窄。两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结，右侧声带相对稍厚。影像诊断：1.头颅CT平扫未见明显异常，必要时MRI检查；鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚，请结合专科检查。2.C4\\/5、C5\\/6椎间盘轻微突出；颈椎失稳；两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结；右侧声带相对稍厚。\",\"date\":\"2025-06-04\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"body_part\":\"颈椎椎间盘、头颅\",\"category\":\"影像学检查\",\"diagnosis\":\"1.头颅CT平扫未见明显异常，必要时MRI检查；鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚，请结合专科检查。2.C4\\/5、C5\\/6椎间盘轻微突出；颈椎失稳；两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结；右侧声带相对稍厚。\",\"result_value\":\"头颅CT平扫脑实质未见明显异常密度影，各脑室形态大小正常，脑沟裂池未见异常，中线结构居中，小脑及脑干未见异常。鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚。颈椎序列整齐，生理曲度平直，椎体缘骨质增生，C4\\/5、C5\\/6椎间盘稍向后突出，相邻硬膜囊稍受压，骨性椎管无明显狭窄。两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结，右侧声带相对稍厚。\",\"sort_order\":null,\"sub_category\":\"CT平扫\"}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州工业园区星塘医院\",\"title\":\"颈椎椎间盘平扫、头颅平扫（CT）\"}", "id": "AF625E3A-1EBC-41EF-BB3E-0579F8DEE4DA"}], "prescriptions": [], "medical_cases": []}}}, "parent_tool_call_id": "call_02_QiIPX79cdYynS5tImEZi6657", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:25.239Z", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:25.239Z"}, {"payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "kind": "tool", "id": "7ECC1D66-B089-5361-8BD3-57B59EA1E3C7", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:17.240Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:17.348Z", "tool_call_id": "call_01_WmbJOGfMcwib8dekITcQ2137", "revision": 1779341237347962, "status": "ready", "order_key": 4000, "node_role": "tool"}, {"kind": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。", "name": "generate_structured_health_card"}}}, "id": "6670B124-0E21-53AC-B199-9B1ECFF27E9C", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:17.240Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:17.389Z", "tool_call_id": "call_02_QiIPX79cdYynS5tImEZi6657", "revision": 1779341237388978, "status": "ready", "order_key": 6000, "node_role": "tool"}, {"kind": "text", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "三份健康卡片已全部生成完毕，以下是汇总：\n\n---\n\n### 📋 卡片一：门诊用药单（处方）\n- **类型**：处方\n- **医院**：苏州大学附属第四医院 皮肤科门诊\n- **日期**：2026年4月20日\n- **诊断**：结膜炎\n- **药品**：\n  | 药品 | 规格 | 用法 |\n  |------|------|------|\n  | 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵） | 5ml:5mg | 滴眼，每日4次，每次1滴 |\n  | 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平） | 6ml:3mg (0.05%) | 滴眼，每日2次，每次1滴 |\n  > ⚠️ 爱赛平开启后使用不可超过四周。\n\n---\n\n### 📋 卡片二：胃"}}, "id": "C5E8C444-D54D-53F5-82E1-0755039F928E", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:17.249Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:27:17.249Z", "revision": 1779341237251114, "status": "ready", "order_key": 7000, "node_role": "timeline"}], "tombstone": false, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "role": "assistant", "client_message_id": "CB1765FD-41FC-4A22-932A-6CEEC7E9F2F9", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_max_messages": 20, "delivery_state": "sending", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:26:45.460Z"}]}
