INFO 2026-05-21 05:28:52,506 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=3F64B2EB-7F4B-4DED-966C-7326CB7635B5] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MzQyNzM5LCJpYXQiOjE3NzkzNDA5MzksImp0aSI6ImVkYmM0ZjYzYzRjMzQyYWJiYmQyYjI0YzFhNjM4NDM2IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjQifQ.KDBGttEOWsd31j4l3s2fOY4UQfgVQx_rDOjrx1PzvDI", "X-Request-Id": "3F64B2EB-7F4B-4DED-966C-7326CB7635B5", "Content-Length": "5935"} body={"messages": [{"blocks": [{"updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "order_key": 1000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "revision": 1779341331522314, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，我先为你提炼这两份报告的关键信息，然后分别生成对应的健康卡片。\n\n---\n\n## 第一份：门诊用药单\n\n**提炼关键信息：**\n\n- 医院：苏州大学附属第四医院\n- 姓名：赵道凯，男，27岁\n- 科室：皮肤科门诊\n- 诊断：结膜炎\n- 药品1：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵），5ml:5mg，滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n- 药品2：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平），6ml:3mg（0.05%），滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴，提示：开启瓶封后使用不可超过四周\n- 日期：2026/04/20\n\n现在生成第一张卡片："}}, "node_role": "timeline", "status": "ready", "kind": "text", "id": "F18438D7-553E-5250-837E-9238083DD23D"}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.591Z", "order_key": 2000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "revision": 1779341331591306, "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "node_role": "tool", "status": "ready", "kind": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904", "id": "363DA21F-75FE-54BD-AF59-95A612BD8917"}, {"id": "93CA6A30-910F-59AB-9DB2-5D7A64F1BAA4", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:38.895Z", "revision": 1779341318895482, "order_key": 2100, "tool_call_id": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:38.895Z", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medical_cases": [], "medications": [], "prescriptions": [{"draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"16:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼。开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg\",\"total_quantity\":null}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"}", "id": "338E197C-968F-4A96-9533-BF47560A9F80", "is_saved": false, "oss_file_id": 539, "subtitle": "结膜炎", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院"}], "exam_reports": []}}}, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "status": "ready", "parent_block_id": "363DA21F-75FE-54BD-AF59-95A612BD8917", "anchor": {"value": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904", "type": "toolCall"}}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "order_key": 3000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "revision": 1779341331523827, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## 第二份：胃镜诊断报告单\n\n**提炼关键信息：**\n\n- 医院：苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\n- 姓名：赵道凯，男，28岁\n- 申请科室：消化内科门诊\n- 检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含麻醉费）\n- 内镜所见：食管黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门圆开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常\n- 诊断：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n- 报告时间：2026-02-10\n\n现在生成第二张卡片："}}, "node_role": "timeline", "status": "ready", "kind": "text", "id": "F18439D7-553E-5403-837E-8F38083DCD24"}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.593Z", "order_key": 4000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "revision": 1779341331592890, "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "node_role": "tool", "status": "ready", "kind": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_00_gRscSLb5iZSwAUe2nUwe1860", "id": "414B2F19-8F00-5BA7-9ECD-8D5B612A3D79"}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "order_key": 5000, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "revision": 1779341331562944, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## 总结\n\n两张健康卡片已为你生成完毕：\n\n| 序号 | 卡片类型 | 标题 | 关联文件ID |\n|------|----------|------|------------|\n| 1 | **处方卡片** | 结膜炎 — 普拉洛芬滴眼液 + 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液 | 539 |\n| 2 | **检查报告卡片** | 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流（胃镜） | 538 |\n\n两份报告均来自苏州大学附属第四医院，患者赵道凯。用药单对应眼部结膜炎的滴眼治疗，胃镜报告则提示胃部存在胆汁反流问题，建议关注消化内科"}}, "node_role": "timeline", "status": "ready", "kind": "text", "id": "F1843AD7-553E-55B6-837E-9038083DCED7"}], "client_message_id": "874031A7-BEF2-4CF5-873F-D7890B6A63A9", "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.595Z", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_id": "E8DAF784-78E2-4578-8D44-1C90E39F75A4", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_max_messages": 20, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.671Z", "delivery_state": "sending", "tombstone": false, "role": "assistant"}]}
