INFO 2026-05-21 07:22:50,065 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=A3865999-705D-46A0-BB16-FCA8D1F7EDED] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MzQ4MzYzLCJpYXQiOjE3NzkzNDY1NjMsImp0aSI6IjE0OTMyMzUwZmJmNzRiODU5Y2VjOGFhNjE3ZDExMjAwIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjQifQ.e-dcM_3cFN62XOvoqYuat7Ykvr1fyxoBd5v7Ma6cN4U", "X-Request-Id": "A3865999-705D-46A0-BB16-FCA8D1F7EDED", "Content-Length": "2815"} body={"messages": [{"model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "delivery_state": "sending", "tombstone": false, "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.317Z", "thread_id": "D3F18E3C-0437-4540-B7BF-F5F0A68F42E2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:28.529Z", "blocks": [{"updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.309Z", "status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.286Z", "node_role": "timeline", "id": "40554A0D-F26E-5974-BB5D-3E7081C361AE", "order_key": 900, "kind": "deepThought", "revision": 1779348169309341, "payload": {"deep_thought": {"_0": {"reasoning_content": "用户问\"主要参数是什么\"，这是在刚才生成的检验报告卡片基础上追问的。我需要从刚才的报告中提炼出关键的参数信息。\n\n让我回顾一下报告中的核心指标：\n\n1. 白细胞系统 - WBC、中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、hs-CRP\n2. 红细胞系统 - RBC、HGB、HCT\n3. 血小板 - PLT\n\n这些就是主要参数。我直接总结给用户即可。", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4147}}}}, {"updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.289Z", "status": "ready", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.289Z", "node_role": "timeline", "id": "F5893AE3-9B16-5099-9C96-C3DFBFCFD112", "order_key": 1000, "kind": "text", "revision": 1779348169288992, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "这份报告的核心参数集中在三大系统，总结如下：\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 炎症/感染指标（白细胞系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **WBC** 白细胞计数 | 5.56 | 3.5–9.5 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **NE#** 中性粒细胞计数 | 3.24 | 1.8–6.3 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **LY#** 淋巴细胞计数 | 1.95 | 1.1–3.2 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **hs-CRP** 超敏C反应蛋白 | **0.93** | 0–6 mg/L | ✅ 无炎症 |\n\n---\n\n### 🟠 贫血指标（红细胞系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **RBC** 红细胞计数 | 4.74 | 4.3–5.8 ×10¹²/L | ✅ |\n| **HGB** 血红蛋白 | 141 | 130–175 g/L | ✅ |\n| **HCT** 红细胞比积 | 41.30% | 40–50% | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 凝血指标（血小板系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **PLT** 血小板计数 | 270 | 125–350 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n**一句话总结**：三大系统全部正常，hs-CRP 仅 0.93（极低水平），确认体内无明显炎症，与\"肠功能紊乱\"诊断一致。"}}}], "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "role": "assistant", "client_message_id": "99608214-B8C3-4895-A6C3-E43823FDC566", "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro"}]}
