INFO 2026-05-21 09:18:35,631 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=D0D83CE3-0980-4BA2-90BE-44599CEBAF53] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=15 bytes=6336 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMjBUMTQ6MDA6MTcuMzk5ODE1KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI1MDYifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "f3ba7309-f733-43be-8998-f53f3c0a5fc8", "server_message_id": "62b9e438-f951-4d02-8e2f-34515fcaed5b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:55.848000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:56.575216+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "DC29E473-8D5D-4BC8-8E94-8C12993ACAE6", "kind": "imageGallery", "status": "ready", "payload": {"image_gallery": {"_0": [{"id": "16CCFA5C-EEB3-437F-8095-05032E37155B", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260520/AB52B8F5-E91F-478A-9D65-FDD0251D67F2/IMG_2030.jpeg", "text": "门诊号：0000319050\n窗口：6号\n她名 赵道凯\n传別：男\n年龄：27岁\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n2026 04/20 262\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称 成格\n药品数量用法\n（MY25 02 04） 普拉洛芬滴眼\n液（普南扑贝）\n1盒\n5上、51\nMi25 02-04\n2 1/192.168.31.39\n扣法：滴眼 每天1次 每次1滴\n支有提示：无\n商眼液（爱赛平）\n（MY25-01-04）盐酸氮卓斯灯\n1盒\n1a:31g0.05%\nMi2: 01-04\n旧U..商眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n可刀：开后软製后，使不可搖过四间。\n1盒\nMY19-03-02\n用法：口服-每下2次 每次2袋\n不起$30\n按存.\n友清提水：\n请感仔细长对药品，如您所取药\n白日录\n不考或有疑问，请暂勿使用。\n药品一经发小，\n概小退换。\n咨询电话：\n0512 6595523/\n容间电话。0512 65955223\n药物线下咨前\n周一至周扣门診药房咨制室\n周四下午-或周五下不點望门这樣班\n关注的学郎公\n上容间", "type": "image", "file_id": 487, "file_md5": "1b74a23cee7f2c3f5614227c47089f5a", "full_cache_key": "ab52b8f5-e91f-478a-9d65-fdd0251d67f2/IMG_2030.jpeg"}]}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "created_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:55.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:55.000Z", "client_message_id": "f3ba7309-f733-43be-8998-f53f3c0a5fc8", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "F484F70B-F045-4504-8C71-AAA3AFF18F65", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "结构化数据"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "created_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:55.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:55.000Z", "client_message_id": "f3ba7309-f733-43be-8998-f53f3c0a5fc8", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "05e950b3-6d30-44e4-b105-8bb7712c5982", "server_message_id": "ea449b61-1e9a-46cc-82a9-0f48df675885", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-20T13:59:55.885000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:13.814273+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "42AE5F28-95FD-5D6D-BD8D-6E24E319AF22", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "根据图片识别内容，我为你整理如下结构化信息：\n\n---\n\n## 处方信息结构化数据\n\n| 字段 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **门诊号** | 0000319050 |\n| **姓名** | 赵道凯 |\n| **性别** | 男 |\n| **年龄** | 27岁 |\n| **科室** | 皮肤科门诊 |\n| **日期** | 2026年4月20日 |\n| **诊断** | 结膜炎 |\n\n---\n\n### 药品明细\n\n| 序号 | 药品名称 | 规格/批号 | 数量 | 用法 | 频次 | 备注 |\n|------|----------|-----------|------|------|------|------|\n| 1 | **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）** | MY25-02-04 | 1盒 | 滴眼 | 每天1次，每次1滴 | — |\n| 2 | **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）** | MY25-01-04，0.05% | 1盒 | 滴眼 | 每天2次，每次1滴 | 开瓶后使用不可超过四周 |\n| 3 | **（口服药，名称未清晰识别）** | MY19-03-02 | 1盒 | 口服 | 每天2次，每次2袋 | 不超过30天 |\n\n---\n\n### 医院信息\n- **咨询电话**：0512-65955223\n- **药物咨询时间**：周一至周日门诊药房咨询室；周四下午/周五下午药学门诊\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 注意点\n\n1. **诊断与科室不匹配**：处方显示科室为「皮肤科门诊」，但诊断为「结膜炎」（眼科疾病），建议确认是否为跨科就诊或录入有误。\n\n2. **口服药名称缺失**：第三项药品名称在图片中未能清晰识别，仅能辨识批号 MY19-03-02，建议核对实物。\n\n3. **用药提醒**：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液开瓶后 **4 周内用完**，超期应丢弃。\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你将这些信息保存为健康卡片，或者生成用药提醒任务吗？"}}, "revision": 1779285613152467, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "created_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:13.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:13.000Z", "client_message_id": "05e950b3-6d30-44e4-b105-8bb7712c5982", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "dff37eac-1936-4a78-92ef-c639fc084353", "server_message_id": "744ebae4-d93f-4a3c-a689-7c087837a861", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:16.699000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:17.399815+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "6B319E09-430C-4771-8758-F63567C16443", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "是的"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "fac3764e-f89c-4c98-92fc-a6da1f052921", "created_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:16.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T14:00:16.000Z", "client_message_id": "dff37eac-1936-4a78-92ef-c639fc084353", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
