026-05-20 00:00:00 +08:00 至 2026-05-20 00:00:00 +08:00。\n失败原因判断：查询日期范围无效或解析后 start_date 晚于 end_date\n可能原因：HealthKit 不可用、未授权读取睡眠分析、该时间段没有睡眠样本、设备/模拟器没有 Apple 健康数据，或传入日期超出可查询范围。"}}}, "revision": 1779290975978910, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "32bf1825-3bed-42ae-bfaa-9871a140bd07", "created_at": "2026-05-20T15:29:35.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T15:29:35.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_4rb6rvy95cuhnp1hzcnjqn1g", "client_message_id": "cc3348c8-19c7-45f5-89ac-177d238e064c", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "E9501210-27B0-5BD5-A674-D299926E8C5E", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "抱歉，未查询到您2026-05-20的睡眠记录，可能是尚未同步睡眠数据或该时间段无睡眠样本。建议您检查设备的睡眠监测设置，或补充授权健康数据读取权限，以便后续为您提供睡眠分析。"}}, "revision": 1779290975977777, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "32bf1825-3bed-42ae-bfaa-9871a140bd07", "created_at": "2026-05-20T15:29:35.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T15:29:35.000Z", "client_message_id": "cc3348c8-19c7-45f5-89ac-177d238e064c", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
