）**  \n   - 规格：5ml:5mg  \n   - 数量：1盒  \n   - 用法：滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴  \n\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**  \n   - 规格：6ml:3mg（0.05%）  \n   - 数量：1盒  \n   - 用法：滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴  \n   - 提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周  \n\n（结构化处方卡片已生成并保存）"}}, "revision": 1779291248015331, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "005bc089-9fc5-430e-a45b-97f586198ffe", "created_at": "2026-05-20T15:34:08.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T15:34:08.000Z", "client_message_id": "b59eae6d-cf26-4670-9764-4e7826fa9dbc", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
