\n- 💊 梳理用药方案和注意事项\n- 📊 生成结构化的健康卡片，方便保存和查看\n\n请告诉我你需要什么帮助？"}}, "revision": 1779354253957608, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "0da0fe6f-1b29-42f8-b88a-a3a6b480a901", "created_at": "2026-05-21T09:04:13.958Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T09:04:13.958Z", "client_message_id": "cfbe1878-d01c-41f6-b93d-4f04b923d4f1", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
