INFO 2026-05-21 09:19:39,954 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=53979DDF-58DF-4E6B-8F58-54F3360B0F9B] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=16 bytes=23465 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMjFUMDg6NDc6MzUuNjc0MjkwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI3MTMifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "06351be1-8921-4a37-b38a-2c8a04b27ae6", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "d988e907-acbc-48db-83c2-f547d1e9dcb2", "server_message_id": "9001f32a-8658-4e62-bc49-d178715a19a2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:49.894000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:50.681585+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "087A6B6E-3509-472F-8B8D-03046CC58A06", "kind": "imageGallery", "status": "ready", "payload": {"image_gallery": {"_0": [{"id": "9A6A0281-D8A7-4FDC-BB15-AB87A5375599", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/487BACA4-EC52-4D32-A4FE-BFFE4F7224DA/IMG_1247.png", "text": "苏州大学附属第四医院\n苏州市独墅湖医院\n胃镜诊断报告单\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n年龄：28 岁\n申请科室：消化内科门诊\n门诊号：0000349056\n住院号：\n床号：\n病区：\n检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含林醉费）\n申请单号：260821105\n①食管\n②齿状线\n③胃底\n①胃体\n⑤胃角\n6胃窦\n⑦十二指肠球部\n⑧十二指肠降部\n内镜所见：\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\n贵门：开合佳通畅；\n胃底：黏膜正常；\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\n胃角：光整；\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红为主；\n幽门：圆，开放好；\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\n诊断：\n慢性非菱缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n活检部位：\n建议：\n报告医生：健\n审核医师：F26\n报告时间：2026-02-10\n备注：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！", "type": "image", "file_id": 556, "file_md5": "b549c88052b52d02e02867117b763749", "full_cache_key": "487baca4-ec52-4d32-a4fe-bffe4f7224da/IMG_1247.png"}, {"id": "665794CD-043C-4040-8397-0024686A5E95", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/FECB4BB0-B048-4D3F-82D1-AF81C01E080D/IMG_1992.jpeg", "text": "SENIU\n非类固醇性抗炎症滴眼液\n普南扑灵®\n普拉洛芬\n滴眼液\n外\n5ml:5mg\n批准文号：国药准字HU20130682\n上市许可持有人：\nSENJU PHARMACEUTICAL CO.， LTD.\n生产企业：\nSENJU PHARMACEUTICAL CO.， LTD.\nFukusaki Plant\n生产地址：\n767-7, Aza Kazukanounonishi, Sajji，\n5少\nFukusakicho, Kanzaki-gun, Hyogo-ken,Japan\n门诊号", "type": "image", "file_id": 555, "file_md5": "122088e38f06563b55d360e1d5a2fd19", "full_cache_key": "fecb4bb0-b048-4d3f-82d1-af81c01e080d/IMG_1992.jpeg"}]}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "06351be1-8921-4a37-b38a-2c8a04b27ae6", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z", "client_message_id": "d988e907-acbc-48db-83c2-f547d1e9dcb2", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "6A6BCAE3-7DBB-4CA9-B288-7F8240242CD5", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "药品和报告抽取\n不要任何解读 只调用 结构化工具就行"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "06351be1-8921-4a37-b38a-2c8a04b27ae6", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:49.894Z", "client_message_id": "d988e907-acbc-48db-83c2-f547d1e9dcb2", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "06351be1-8921-4a37-b38a-2c8a04b27ae6", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "6e788b81-2be5-4846-961d-38f52f8ad608", "server_message_id": "3553d67a-bdd1-4176-80e2-95234a846678", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:37:49.958000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:39:08.848199+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "4C352A1D-6E3C-5E4D-A20D-94B9C150F323", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿