ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "不要输出任何多余内容 直接调回处方可视化卡片"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "ee55b918-d860-4bae-90b6-5e5dc9ac9a11", "created_at": "2026-05-20T15:26:37.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T15:26:37.000Z", "client_message_id": "3133816e-32f2-42a0-bde7-f5b8407c0648", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ee55b918-d860-4bae-90b6-5e5dc9ac9a11", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-mini-260428", "client_message_id": "91963e48-a610-4f3b-b884-ad75936ff784", "server_message_id": "1fedacf0-a720-4969-bd02-cb2edee506ad", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-20T15:26:37.636000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-20T15:26:49.449373+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "64AF5CAF-E705-5548-8BC2-E35C4495FFC7", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。"}}}, "revision": 1779290808703557, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "ee55b918-d860-4bae-90b6-5e5dc9ac9a11", "created_at": "2026-05-20T15:26:48.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T15:26:48.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_qddhw1zfby5f1xtnbz2b3p5i", "client_message_id": "91963e48-a610-4f3b-b884-ad75936ff784", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "679B9E6A-6215-56FD-8A67-C6EDF9EA5DEA", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "您的处方信息已整理为结构化健康卡片：\n- 患者：赵道凯，27岁，皮肤科门诊，诊断结膜炎\n- 用药1：普拉洛芬滴眼液(普南扑灵)，5ml:5mg，1盒，用法：滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴\n- 用药2：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液(爱赛平)，6ml:3mg(0.05%)，1盒，用法：滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴，开启后使用不可超过四周"}}, "revision": 1779290808702