区间：2025-06-18 00:00:00 +08:00 至 2025-06-18 00:00:00 +08:00。\n失败原因判断：查询日期范围无效或解析后 start_date 晚于 end_date\n可能原因：HealthKit 不可用、未授权读取睡眠分析、该时间段没有睡眠样本、设备/模拟器没有 Apple 健康数据，或传入日期超出可查询范围。"}}}, "revision": 1779332058473146, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "5629a515-00b8-4692-be6a-33009f149dee", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:18.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:18.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_6zwh2775r55swvg3owyw6w56", "client_message_id": "0cc1b7ed-5e6d-4178-8fe9-c017aed90fae", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "D80727E7-A535-5162-ACE7-E9873E3CD007", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "抱歉，未能查询到你昨天（2025-06-18）的睡眠记录。可能的原因包括：设备未授权读取睡眠数据、昨天没有佩戴设备记录睡眠，或者健康数据尚未同步。你可以检查一下设备的健康权限设置，或者确认昨天的睡眠是否被正常记录哦。"}}, "revision": 1779332058471710, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "5629a515-00b8-4692-be6a-33009f149dee", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:18.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:18.000Z", "client_message_id": "0cc1b7ed-5e6d-4178-8fe9-c017aed90fae", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "5629a515-00b8-4692-be6a-33009f149dee", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "4a1a2d19-42fa-4910-8dc3-9784ecebbcee", "server_message_id": "8e1a870a-85a2-4a1e-b19a-08f657b955a4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:33.453000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:34.111037+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "C824330D-23C9-4BB9-8777-6DFABF759B8B", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "昨天到今日睡眠情况怎么样"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "5629a515-00b8-4692-be6a-33009f149dee", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:33.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:54:33.000Z", "client_message_id": 