INFO 2026-05-21 10:21:42,306 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=BAE0417B-0F07-4618-8E4B-00CA0127BD2C] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=7 bytes=3328 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMjFUMDU6MTM6MTkuODQxMTk1KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2NjYifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "a6005715-4fcc-4665-99ca-962b04dce452", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "fc1db536-727e-4817-95b2-32b0e38959d6", "server_message_id": "d46160f3-3cfb-4a32-87e4-1de5e8bfc837", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:08.540000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:09.224145+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "C7B0D8B7-EC72-4E48-B228-D7818379FDF7", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "ageBlock payload 解码失败"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "a6005715-4fcc-4665-99ca-962b04dce452", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:08.540Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:08.540Z", "client_message_id": "fc1db536-727e-4817-95b2-32b0e38959d6", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "a6005715-4fcc-4665-99ca-962b04dce452", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "44aeca6e-773e-40be-8f3d-91be19f68286", "server_message_id": "b09e75de-798e-4a27-b279-8eaae02a17bb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:08.561000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:19.841195+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "8FC9DE45-7DC5-51C0-AE64-EC7B7895CE49", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "看起来你遇到了一个技术问题——`ageBlock payload 解码失败`，这通常出现在某些健康/医疗类应用或 SDK 的数据解析过程中。\n\n为了更准确地帮你排查，我需要了解更多信息：\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 请提供以下细节：\n\n1. **出现的场景**：\n   - 是在哪个 App / 平台 / SDK 中遇到的？（例如：某健康管理 App、微信小程序、Web 端等）\n   - 是在上传报告、查看健康数据、还是其他操作时出现的？\n\n2. **错误完整信息**：\n   - 能否提供完整的报错日志或截图？\n   - 是否有其他伴随的错误码或提示？\n\n3. **操作步骤**：\n   - 你当时在进行什么操作？（如扫码、上传体检报告、同步数据等）\n   - 是偶发还是每次必现？\n\n4. **环境信息**：\n   - 设备型号、系统版本\n   - App 版本号\n\n---\n\n### 🛠 常见可能原因（供参考）：\n\n| 可能原因 | 说明 |\n|---------|------|\n| **数据格式不匹配** | payload 编码方式与解码预期不一致（Base64 / Protobuf / JSON 等） |\n| **版本不兼容** | 客户端版本过旧，无法解析新版数据结构 |\n| **数据损坏** | 传输过程中 payload 被截断或损坏 |\n| **加密/签名问题** | ageBlock 需要"}}, "revision": 1779340398802039, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "a6005715-4fcc-4665-99ca-962b04dce452", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.802Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:13:18.802Z", "client_message_id": "44aeca6e-773e-40be-8f3d-91be19f68286", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
