用药清单和处方信息\n- 📊 生成结构化的健康卡片，方便保存和回顾\n- 🩺 提供通俗易懂的医学解释和健康建议\n\n请直接发送你想让我分析的内容吧！"}}, "revision": 1779340478252491, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "08760bb4-b908-4aab-9a1e-a215def92893", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:14:38.252Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:14:38.252Z", "client_message_id": "48de19ef-4291-4e79-ac68-e8313c7859ae", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
