查阅。\n- **解读医学报告**：如果你有检查报告看不懂，可以发给我，我来帮你解读。\n- **用药提醒与管理**：记录你的用药信息，帮你梳理用药计划。\n- **健康建议**：根据你提供的信息，给出针对性的健康指导。\n\n请告诉我你今天需要什么帮助？比如有报告要上传、有指标想了解，或者想记录用药情况？"}}, "revision": 1779340528715269, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "d970ef21-e2bd-4036-9767-afb23a93beea", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:15:28.715Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:15:28.715Z", "client_message_id": "e8c42685-f43d-42a8-803d-52669694ee5f", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
