"parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "78453AE6-D92D-54CB-9C4C-21E36D8DC860", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "根据你的睡眠数据，为你整理这两天的睡眠情况如下：\n\n### 📅 **2026年5月19日睡眠数据**\n- **总睡眠时长**：5小时51分钟\n- **睡眠结构**：\n  - **深度睡眠**：54分钟（占比15.5%），有助于身体恢复\n  - **核心睡眠**：3小时21分钟（占比57.6%），主要睡眠阶段\n  - **REM睡眠**：1小时36分钟（占比27.5%），与记忆和情绪调节相关\n- **清醒时间**：仅3分钟（0.9%），睡眠连续性较好\n\n### ⚠️ **2026年5月20日睡眠数据**\n未查询到该日期的睡眠记录，可能是：\n1. 当天未佩戴睡眠监测设备\n2. 设备未同步数据或授权未开启\n\n### 💡 **健康建议**\n1. **深度睡眠占比略低（理想建议：20-25%）**：可尝试睡前减少电子设备使用，保持卧室黑暗安静，有助于提升深度睡眠时间\n2. **5月19日睡眠总时长不足7-9小时的推荐量**：建议近期尽量保证7-8小时睡眠，避免熬夜\n3. **若5月20日有睡眠，可补充说明或检查设备同步情况**：若当天有佩戴设备，可尝试重新同步数据\n\n需要我帮你分析睡眠质量的具体影响因素，或制定改善睡眠的计划吗？"}}, "revision": 1779293017360558, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "thread_id": "a67d794a-be3c-4289-ade5-b25979dfd357", "created_at": "2026-05-20T16:03:37.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T16:03:37.000Z", "client_message_id": "39c749b8-9793-4808-949c-b7ba6742c722", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "a67d794a-be3c-4289-ade5-b25979dfd357", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "5a68cf24-d4fd-4747-9410-bd80faa1be65", "server_message_id": "c8a94e8f-7855-4efe-8e48-2f0f5e81a383", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-20T16:01:23.707000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:22:24.416118+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "DFA111FB-D824-5B6E-9504-F4F93047C52F", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "我来帮你分析这份门诊用药单，并为你生成结构化的健康数据。\n\n首先让我确认一下：这份用药单是关于**赵道凯**，27岁男性，诊断为**结膜炎**，医生开了两种滴眼液。\n\n让我为你生成两张用药卡片："}}, "revision": 1779292914667193, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "a67d794a-be3c-4289-ade5-b25979dfd357", "created_at": "2026-05-20T16:01:54.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T16:01:54.000Z", "client_message_id": "5a68cf24-d4fd-4747-9410-bd80faa1be65", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "51EE0F11-A1E7-52DE-8049-167FE34335AA", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。"}}}, "revision": 1779292914669143, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "a67d794a-be3c-4289-ade5-b25979dfd357", "created_at": "2026-05-20T16:01:54.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T16:01:54.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_oHLz0D4twjPnxkM4kqql3668", "client_message_id": "5a68cf24-d4fd-4747-9410-bd80faa1be65", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "7524F9C5-1DAC-5A88-927D-63F095C303F5", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_01_evSftX2RP3j4fJWZLOkw5322"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [{"id": "74F6E4DF-6D8F-4FB1-AFF1-6FD3C5C29DA8", "is_saved": false, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"end_date\":\"2026-05-27\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日4次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴入患眼，避免瓶口接触眼部\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"medicine_type\":\"western\",\"reminder_enabled\":true,\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"18:00\",\"22:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"start_date\":\"2026-05-20\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":null}", "dosage_line": "1滴 · 每日4次", "display_name": "普拉洛芬滴眼液", "specification": "5ml:5mg 滴眼液"}, {"id": "41D3DDB3-A715-445D-8129-1EF460357625", "is_saved": false, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_n