",\"dose_value\":null,\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼。开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液(爱赛平)\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"prescription_no\":\"0000349056\"}"}]}}}, "revision": 1779318715480636, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "366f235f-7bc6-4fab-8f0e-002d8f3d3d43", "created_at": "2026-05-20T23:11:55.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T23:11:55.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_idm12amjc6how1cb0t8opm9s", "parent_block_id": "81AEE506-6049-5AF4-95ED-CAAF67F172F7", "client_message_id": "9c957a9b-8f0b-4fca-aaea-1abe7b4d916d", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_idm12amjc6how1cb0t8opm9s"}, {"id": "3331A74A-2D18-5186-AE2B-DAA39D358CF3", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已完成处方信息抽取并生成结构化健康卡片，核心信息如下：\n### 处方概览\n- 医院：苏州大学附属第四医院\n- 类型：门诊用药单\n- 就诊人：赵道凯（男，27岁）\n- 科室：皮肤科门诊\n- 就诊时间：2026-04-20 10:11\n- 诊断：结膜炎\n\n### 药品明细\n1. **普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）**\n   - 规格：5ml:5mg\n   - 数量：1盒\n   - 用法：滴眼，每日4次，每次1滴\n\n2. **盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）**\n   - 规格：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\n   - 数量：1盒\n   - 用法：滴眼，每日2次，每次1滴\n   - 注意：开启后使用不可超过4周\n\n你可以点击卡片保存到健康档案，后续也可随时查询用药提醒。"}}, "revision": 1779318724668393, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "366f235f-7bc6-4fab-8f0e-002d8f3d3d43", "created_at": "2026-05-20T23:12:04.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T23:12:04.000Z", "client_message_id": "9c957a9b-8f0b-4fca-aaea-1abe7b4d916d", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
