id": "call_00_sJjF0Fl5ReaH528og91b8490", "client_message_id": "d4de3ae3-3576-44ac-8fb9-eccbbd3229d4", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "E565CF39-D0AF-5470-A143-3F95D3EFF4C1", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_sJjF0Fl5ReaH528og91b8490"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [], "medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": [{"id": "B8881AD0-C84F-4C10-B5F9-33324C02FA9D", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": false, "subtitle": "结膜炎", "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"16:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼。开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"}", "oss_file_id": 513}]}}}, "revision": 1779328564732901, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "409e2960-d41e-4539-9be3-8a6bf23fc0c8", "created_at": "2026-05-21T01:56:04.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T01:56:04.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_sJjF0Fl5ReaH528og91b8490", "parent_block_id": "DF5E5CF0-FACF-5808-BF8B-A6245280B4CC", "client_message_id": "d4de3ae3-3576-44ac-8fb9-eccbbd3229d4", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_sJjF0Fl5ReaH528og91b8490"}, {"id": "C2F9D0F3-39E4-5753-88BB-8B9CA4DECB30", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为你结构化这张处方，以下是关键信息概览：\n\n---\n\n## 🏥 处方信息摘要\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **医院** | 苏州大学附属第四医院 |\n| **患者** | 赵道凯，男，27岁 |\n| **科室** | 皮肤科门诊 |\n| **诊断** | **结膜炎** |\n| **日期** | 2026年4月20日 |\n\n---\n\n## 💊 用药明细\n\n### ① 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\n- 规格：5ml:5mg\n- 用法：**滴眼，每日4次，每次1滴**\n- 作用：非甾体抗炎药（NSAID），用于缓解眼部炎症和红肿\n\n### ② 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\n- 规格：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\n- 用法：**滴眼，每日2次，每次1滴**\n- 作用：抗组胺药，用于缓解过敏性结膜炎的瘙痒、流泪等症状\n- ⚠️ **注意**：开启后使用不可超过4周，到期应丢弃\n\n---\n\n## 📌 用药提醒\n\n两种滴眼液如同时使用，建议**间隔5-10分钟**，先用普拉洛芬（消炎），再用氮卓斯汀（抗过敏），以确保药效充分发挥。如有不适请及时复诊。\n\n---\n\n结构化处方卡片已在后台生成，你可以点击下方卡片保存到健康档案中。需要我进一步解读或设置用药提醒吗？"}}, "revision": 1779328564218010, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "409e2960-d41e-4539-9be3-8a6bf23fc0c8", "created_at": "2026-05-21T01:56:04.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T01:56:04.000Z", "client_message_id": "d4de3ae3-3576-44ac-8fb9-eccbbd3229d4", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
