": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "处方卡片已生成。该门诊处方包含以下要点：\n\n- **诊断**：结膜炎\n- **药品1**：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）5ml:5mg，每日4次，每次1滴\n- **药品2**：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）6ml:3mg(0.05%)，每日2次，每次1滴；注意开封后4周内用完"}}, "revision": 1779329480961812, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "dfe1ca7f-b9ef-4934-8797-a0313ba2351c", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:20.000Z", "client_message_id": "6bc20d00-d5a1-4505-ad40-f034c944268d", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
