ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "不要输出任何多余文字内容 \n直接调用 generate_structured_health_card 带入合适的参数  其他都不要输出"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "64f59424-3fc7-408f-86cd-a99276814506", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:53.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:53.000Z", "client_message_id": "843e9efe-fcde-4792-86e8-93553e411224", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64f59424-3fc7-408f-86cd-a99276814506", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "c85a1089-2c5a-4b34-8f13-256e2fabe593", "server_message_id": "903edf11-1a94-486f-ae2d-2590ce98b07b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:11:53.573000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:22:24.555087+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "0E26EAC3-7DF8-5576-A73E-8B56BFDCE50D", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。"}}}, "revision": 1779329537139801, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "64f59424-3fc7-408f-86cd-a99276814506", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:12:17.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:12:17.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_11afis5u5ra9n8h3h1gxy4rm", "client_message_id": "c85a1089-2c5a-4b34-8f13-256e2fabe593", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "EA6A916F-A544-5E16-A60C-6B376D4C74E2", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_11afis5u5ra9n8h3h1gxy4rm"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [], "medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": [{"id": "9A031654-7670-4A25-83AE-CE055865DD66", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": false, "subtitle": "结膜炎", "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\",\"medicine_type\":\"眼科用药\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"16:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼，开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\",\"medicine_type\":\"眼科用药\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"prescription_no\":\"0000349056\"}"}]}}}, "revision": 1779329537072298, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "64f59424-3fc7-408f-86cd-a99276814506", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:12:17.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:12:17.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_11afis5u5ra9n8h3h1gxy4rm", "parent_block_id": "0E26EAC3-7DF8-5576-A73E-8B56BFDCE50D", "client_message_id": "c85a1089-2c5a-4b34-8f13-256e2fabe593", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_11afis5u5ra9n8h3h1gxy4rm"}, {"id": "569906FB-22C4-522B-A325-DAA51B10E0E8", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成结构化处方健康卡片，本次处方相关信息如下：\n就诊人赵道凯（27岁男性）2026年4月20日于苏州大学附属第四医院皮肤科门诊就诊，诊断为结膜炎，开具两种滴眼液：\n1. 普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）：5ml:5mg规格，共1盒，每日滴眼4次，每次1滴。\n2. 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）：6ml:3mg(0.05%)规格，共1盒，每日滴眼2次，每次1滴，开启后使用不可超过4周。\n请遵医嘱用药，用药期间若有不适请及时复诊。"}}, "revision": 1779329537138394, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "64f59424-3fc7-408f-86cd-a99276814506", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:12:17.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:12:17.000Z", "client_message_id": "c85a1089-2c5a-4b34-8f13-256e2fabe593", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
