*：滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n\n### 2. 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\n- **规格**：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\n- **用法**：滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n- **⚠️ 提示**：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周", "shows_save_and_copy": true}]}}, "revision": 1779330590784875, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "10641f81-c97e-4881-8d56-a200e2361e87", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:50.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:50.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_MwQvh1qYSrs3dW7dY2vk4877", "client_message_id": "4e37cfd6-e9e3-433f-9f66-5a57871c4269", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null}, {"id": "0E90DDDA-5199-5FBA-B80C-BFC340496A42", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "create_knowledge_document", "content": "已生成知识库文档草稿「赵道凯-结膜炎处方-2026.04.20」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。"}}}, "revision": 1779330592790483, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 4000, "thread_id": "10641f81-c97e-4881-8d56-a200e2361e87", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_MwQvh1qYSrs3dW7dY2vk4877", "client_message_id": "4e37cfd6-e9e3-433f-9f66-5a57871c4269", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "2193B327-00CB-5E7F-8CC4-D7CE4BE8D564", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成处方结构化卡片及知识文档草稿，可点击保存。"}}, "revision": 1779330592763359, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "thread_id": "10641f81-c97e-4881-8d56-a200e2361e87", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:29:52.000Z", "client_message_id": "4e37cfd6-e9e3-433f-9f66-5a57871c4269", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
