on": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"16:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_unit\":\"滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼，开启瓶封后使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg(0.05%)\",\"total_quantity\":\"1盒\"}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"\"}", "oss_file_id": 521}]}}}, "revision": 1779330991290506, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "8943ce62-4def-4bd2-b622-bcc1ce3b6300", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:31.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:31.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_GpTWQPFeySLvoudTVMXU4289", "parent_block_id": "E69BB762-1794-5E55-B1B2-247C5A6C543B", "client_message_id": "4fe4a299-fa58-471b-892e-4df8eae1fea8", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_GpTWQPFeySLvoudTVMXU4289"}, {"id": "BA45B676-3726-5C23-B389-B1DBE718AB99", "kind": "knowledgeCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"knowledge_cards": {"_0": [{"id": "3DEC4CB0-2D94-AB92-11AD-CD6F669120E8", "title": "处方：普拉洛芬滴眼液+盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（结膜炎）", "content": "## 处方信息\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 医院 | 苏州大学附属第四医院 |\n| 门诊号 | 0000349056 |\n| 姓名 | 赵道凯 |\n| 性别 | 男 |\n| 年龄 | 27岁 |\n| 科室 | 皮肤科门诊 |\n| 诊断 | 结膜炎 |\n| 日期 | 2026年4月20日 |\n\n---\n\n## 药品明细\n\n### 药品一\n- **名称**：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵）\n- **规格**：5ml:5mg\n- **用法用量**：滴眼，每天4次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n\n### 药品二\n- **名称**：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平）\n- **规格**：6ml:3mg（0.05%）\n- **用法用量**：滴眼，每天2次，每次1滴\n- **数量**：1盒\n- **提示**：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\n\n---\n\n## 用药提醒\n\n- 普拉洛芬为**非甾体抗炎药**，用于缓解眼部炎症；盐酸氮卓斯汀为**抗组胺药**，用于缓解过敏症状\n- 两种滴眼液如需同时使用，建议间隔**5-10分钟**\n- 滴眼前洗净双手，瓶口勿接触眼睛或皮肤\n- 盐酸氮卓斯汀开封后**4周内**用完，过期丢弃", "shows_save_and_copy": true}]}}, "revision": 1779331003987278, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "8943ce62-4def-4bd2-b622-bcc1ce3b6300", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:43.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:43.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271", "client_message_id": "4fe4a299-fa58-471b-892e-4df8eae1fea8", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null}, {"id": "D242E369-EB8B-5074-8FD6-4DA3A5B3D398", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "create_knowledge_document", "content": "已生成知识库文档草稿「处方：普拉洛芬滴眼液+盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（结膜炎）」，内容已附在消息内知识卡中，用户可点击保存到知识库。"}}}, "revision": 1779331007516693, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 4000, "thread_id": "8943ce62-4def-4bd2-b622-bcc1ce3b6300", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_2N1AsfXa6OsxQAhsmzVa5271", "client_message_id": "4fe4a299-fa58-471b-892e-4df8eae1fea8", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "7F722253-CBA4-5DA4-A25F-AF03DAE60041", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成处方知识卡，包含两种滴眼液的用法用量和关键提醒。您可以点击卡片保存到知识库，方便随时查阅。"}}, "revision": 1779331007486284, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "thread_id": "8943ce62-4def-4bd2-b622-bcc1ce3b6300", "created_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T02:36:47.000Z", "client_message_id": "4fe4a299-fa58-471b-892e-4df8eae1fea8", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning