INFO 2026-05-21 10:21:43,594 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=0B2C8917-FD05-4258-B879-53C7EE4AA391] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=12947 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMjFUMDY6MDM6NTkuNTM1NDg0KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2ODYifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "3b0644c1-58e3-4fd2-a12a-4d765a37531b", "server_message_id": "66cee25c-74f7-4c2a-983c-00c55a5c4993", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.635000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:16.403939+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "85C334F6-E53E-40EA-A05C-79A2E4B90F08", "kind": "imageGallery", "status": "ready", "payload": {"image_gallery": {"_0": [{"id": "C20471B2-A1ED-457E-B76A-61AEE6A0D2A8", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/D5C27842-1983-4F5C-8EDA-0CD2114198AE/IMG_1991.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY23-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3ing （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "file_id": 539, "file_md5": "5cd495adce333a42bb781f52c42d7f02", "full_cache_key": "d5c27842-1983-4f5c-8eda-0cd2114198ae/IMG_1991.jpeg"}, {"id": "20C3983D-F7B5-4F05-A14B-ABE8207401C2", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/F4D82F94-3648-4629-BFA3-1747356F267A/IMG_1247.png", "text": "苏州大学附属第四医院\n苏州市独墅湖医院\n胃镜诊断报告单\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n年龄：28 岁\n申请科室：消化内科门诊\n门诊号：0000349056\n住院号：\n床号：\n病区：\n检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含林醉费）\n申请单号：260821105\n①食管\n②齿状线\n③胃底\n①胃体\n⑤胃角\n6胃窦\n⑦十二指肠球部\n⑧十二指肠降部\n内镜所见：\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\n贵门：开合佳通畅；\n胃底：黏膜正常；\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\n胃角：光整；\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红为主；\n幽门：圆，开放好；\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\n诊断：\n慢性非菱缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n活检部位：\n建议：\n报告医生：健\n审核医师：F26\n报告时间：2026-02-10\n备注：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！", "type": "image", "file_id": 538, "file_md5": "b549c88052b52d02e02867117b763749", "full_cache_key": "f4d82f94-3648-4629-bfa3-1747356f267a/IMG_1247.png"}]}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z", "client_message_id": "3b0644c1-58e3-4fd2-a12a-4d765a37531b", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "AB760095-D0B6-496E-B915-128AF8DF14E5", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，我将为你提炼这两份报告的关键信息，并分别生成对应的健康卡片。\n每一份报告生成前 需要表面标题"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.635Z", "client_message_id": "3b0644c1-58e3-4fd2-a12a-4d765a37531b", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "server_message_id": "2cd004f6-e0f6-4d8b-970b-d06a4e018ef6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:15.671000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T06:03:59.535484+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "F18438D7-553E-5250-837E-9238083DD23D", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，我先为你提炼这两份报告的关键信息，然后分别生成对应的健康卡片。\n\n---\n\n## 第一份：门诊用药单\n\n**提炼关键信息：**\n\n- 医院：苏州大学附属第四医院\n- 姓名：赵道凯，男，27岁\n- 科室：皮肤科门诊\n- 诊断：结膜炎\n- 药品1：普拉洛芬滴眼液（普南扑灵），5ml:5mg，滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n- 药品2：盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液（爱赛平），6ml:3mg（0.05%），滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴，提示：开启瓶封后使用不可超过四周\n- 日期：2026/04/20\n\n现在生成第一张卡片："}}, "revision": 1779341331522314, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "363DA21F-75FE-54BD-AF59-95A612BD8917", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779341331591306, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.591Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "93CA6A30-910F-59AB-9DB2-5D7A64F1BAA4", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [], "medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": [{"id": "338E197C-968F-4A96-9533-BF47560A9F80", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": true, "subtitle": "结膜炎", "member_id": 16, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"diagnosis\":\"结膜炎\",\"institution_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"medication_plans\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"普南扑灵\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日四次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼\",\"medicine_name\":\"普拉洛芬滴眼液\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"12:00\",\"16:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"5ml:5mg\",\"total_quantity\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"brand_name\":\"爱赛平\",\"dosage_form\":\"滴眼液\",\"dose_per_time\":\"1滴\",\"dose_value\":\"1\",\"every_n_days\":null,\"frequency_text\":\"每日两次\",\"frequency_type\":\"daily\",\"instructions\":\"滴眼。开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周\",\"medicine_name\":\"盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液\",\"reminder_times\":[\"08:00\",\"20:00\"],\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"status\":\"active\",\"strength\":\"6ml:3mg\",\"total_quantity\":null}],\"prescribed_at\":\"2026-04-20\",\"prescriber_name\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\"}", "oss_file_id": 539}]}}}, "revision": 1779341318895484, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:38.895Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T06:03:58.855Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904", "parent_block_id": "363DA21F-75FE-54BD-AF59-95A612BD8917", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_4rm8MlLOvQhhi5YZvphg2904"}, {"id": "F18439D7-553E-5403-837E-8F38083DCD24", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## 第二份：胃镜诊断报告单\n\n**提炼关键信息：**\n\n- 医院：苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\n- 姓名：赵道凯，男，28岁\n- 申请科室：消化内科门诊\n- 检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含麻醉费）\n- 内镜所见：食管黏膜大致正常；贲门开合佳通畅；胃底黏膜正常；胃体见胆汁残留；胃角光整；胃窦黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门圆开放好；十二指肠球部及降部未见明显异常\n- 诊断：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n- 报告时间：2026-02-10\n\n现在生成第二张卡片："}}, "revision": 1779341331523827, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "414B2F19-8F00-5BA7-9ECD-8D5B612A3D79", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779341331592890, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 4000, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.593Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_gRscSLb5iZSwAUe2nUwe1860", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "C5EF5870-EEF2-5B35-8AB0-CBCC52A3394E", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_gRscSLb5iZSwAUe2nUwe1860"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [{"id": "87359507-BB16-4FDE-9534-FBC3BCA1CE9F", "title": "胃镜诊断报告单", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）", "is_saved": true, "date_text": "2026-02-10", "member_id": 16, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"imaging\",\"content\":\"内镜所见：\\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\\n贲门：开合佳通畅；\\n胃底：黏膜正常；\\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\\n胃角：光整；\\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红为主；\\n幽门：圆，开放好；\\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\\n\\n诊断：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\\n活检部位：无\\n建议：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼自助报告机取报告。\",\"date\":\"2026-02-10\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"内镜检查\",\"diagnosis\":\"慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\",\"result_value\":\"食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；贲门：开合佳通畅；胃底：黏膜正常；胃体：见胆汁残留；胃角：光整；胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红为主；幽门：圆，开放好；十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\",\"sort_order\":null,\"sub_category\":\"无痛电子胃镜\"}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）\",\"title\":\"胃镜诊断报告单\"}", "oss_file_id": 538}], "medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": []}}}, "revision": 1779341336859259, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 4100, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:56.859Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T06:03:55.810Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_gRscSLb5iZSwAUe2nUwe1860", "parent_block_id": "414B2F19-8F00-5BA7-9ECD-8D5B612A3D79", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_gRscSLb5iZSwAUe2nUwe1860"}, {"id": "F1843AD7-553E-55B6-837E-9038083DCED7", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "---\n\n## 总结\n\n两张健康卡片已为你生成完毕：\n\n| 序号 | 卡片类型 | 标题 | 关联文件ID |\n|------|----------|------|------------|\n| 1 | **处方卡片** | 结膜炎 — 普拉洛芬滴眼液 + 盐酸氮卓斯汀滴眼液 | 539 |\n| 2 | **检查报告卡片** | 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流（胃镜） | 538 |\n\n两份报告均来自苏州大学附属第四医院，患者赵道凯。用药单对应眼部结膜炎的滴眼治疗，胃镜报告则提示胃部存在胆汁反流问题，建议关注消化内科"}}, "revision": 1779341331562944, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "thread_id": "e8daf784-78e2-4578-8d44-1c90e39f75a4", "created_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T05:28:51.522Z", "client_message_id": "874031a7-bef2-4cf5-873f-d7890b6a63a9", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
