INFO 2026-05-21 10:21:43,727 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=FD3D4568-04EB-4A65-9E99-0AA693371D54] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=6 bytes=17658 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMjFUMDc6MjI6NTAuMDc1MzQ5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2OTQifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "b9436c81-3288-41de-b628-9eecd803609b", "server_message_id": "fe8cd875-b625-4fee-af85-247cca7e3b1b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:42.594000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:43.306628+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "7C0B05C8-B5C9-4A45-A082-2EEB2F4F9834", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "解读下报告"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:42.593Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:42.593Z", "client_message_id": "b9436c81-3288-41de-b628-9eecd803609b", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "CE423AAC-45CC-4A3C-85C0-B80C3765EC57", "kind": "imageGallery", "status": "ready", "payload": {"image_gallery": {"_0": [{"id": "C21F3341-3C6D-40D8-BCF9-1F2CBB7C3160", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/D6F144E7-C3F8-4612-BBAF-5224F9F2C848/%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E5%85%A8%E8%83%BD%E7%8E%8B%20%E2%81%A82025-7-5%2009.25%E2%81%A9_1-3.jpeg", "text": "苏州大学附属第四医院 检验报告单\n苏HR\nCAL,8000\n苏州市独墅湖医院\nThe Fourth Affliated Hospital of Soochow University（Suzhou Dushu Lake Hospital ） Test Report\n姓名：\n赵道凯\n性别：\n男\n年龄：\n26岁8月\n标本：\n静脉全血\n条码号：225070504252\nNAME：-\nSEX：\nAGE：\nSPECH\nLAB NO：—\n科别：消化内科门诊\n床号：\n门诊号：\n0000349056\n临床印象：肠功能紊乱\n送检项目：血细胞分析+CRP\nDEPT：\nBED NO：\nO.P.NO：\nCLI.IMP：\nTEST OBJ：-\n序号 缩写\n项目名称\n结果\n参考区间\n单位\n序号 缩写\n项目名称\n结果\n参考区间\n单位\n1\n*WBC\n白细胞计数\n5.56\n3.5--9.5\n10~9/L\n13 *HGB\n血红蛋白\n141\n130--175\ng/L\n2 NE#\n中性粒细胞计数\n3.24\n1.8--6.3\n10~9/L\n14 HCT\n红细胞比积\n41.30\n40--50\n%\n3 LY#\n淋巴细胞计数\n1.95\n1.1--3.2\n10~9/L\n15 MCV\n红细胞平均体积\n87.2\n82--100\nfL\n4 MO#\n单核细胞计数\n0.34\n0.1--0.6\n10~9/L\n16 MCH\n红细胞平均血红蛋白量\n29.8\n27--34\n5 EO#\n嗜酸性粒细胞计数\n0.03\n0.02--0.52 10~9/L\n17 MCHC\n红细胞平均血红蛋白浓度\n341\n316--354\ng/L\n6 BA#\n嗜碱性粒细胞计数\n0.00\n0--0.06\n10~9/L\n18 RDW\n红细胞分布宽度\n13.2\n0.0--15.0\n%\n7 NE%\n中性粒细胞百分比\n58.2\n40--75\n%\n19 *PLT\n血小板计数\n270\n125--350\n10~9/L\n8 LY%\n淋巴细胞百分比\n35.1\n20--50\n%\n20 PCT\n血小板比积\n0.240\n0.11--0.28\nMO%\n单核细胞百分比\n6.1\n3--10\n%\n21 MPV\n平均血小板体积\n8.9\n6.5--12\nfL\n10 E0%\n嗜酸性粒细胞百分比\n0.6\n0.4--8\n%\n22 PDW\n血小板分布宽度\n16.0\n≤17\n11 BA%\n嗜碱性粒细胞百分比\n0.0\n0--1\n%\n23 hs-CRP超敏C反应蛋白\n0.93\n0--6\nmg/L\n12 *RBC\n红细胞计数\n4.74\n4.3--5.8\n10~12/L.\n备注：\n检验建议：\n采样时间：\n2025-07-05 08:40\n核收时间：\n2025-07-05 08:46\n报告时间：\n2025-07-05 08:57\nCOLLECT TIME：\nRECIEVE TIME：\nREPORT TIME：\n申请医师：\nDOCTOR：_\n严海荣\nEXAMINOR：\n检验者：\n钱思程\n审核发布者：\nCHECKER：\n冯玎琦\n本报告仅对所测标本负责，如有疑问请3天内与我们联系。\n标注*的项目为江苏省检验互认项目（苏HR）。\n地址：苏州市工业园区崇文路9号2楼F区 联系电话：0512-65955310\n1/1", "type": "image", "file_id": 542, "file_md5": "346f01f2613b3bff0f75a4f18d4fe3a0", "full_cache_key": "d6f144e7-c3f8-4612-bbaf-5224f9f2c848/扫描全能王 ⁨2025-7-5 09.25⁩_1-3.jpeg"}]}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:42.593Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:42.593Z", "client_message_id": "b9436c81-3288-41de-b628-9eecd803609b", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "f44c9743-5bd7-4ec4-a81e-019b85701ab3", "server_message_id": "4ebc6515-6407-4c7f-9eb1-991220a4c290", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:09:42.629000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:08.569306+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "014D61D2-E0A7-523A-B1CA-41397013168F", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，我来为您解读这份**血细胞分析+CRP**检验报告。\n\n---\n\n## 📋 报告概览\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **姓名** | 赵道凯 |\n| **性别** | 男 |\n| **年龄** | 26岁8月 |\n| **科别** | 消化内科门诊 |\n| **临床印象** | 肠功能紊乱 |\n| **采样时间** | 2025-07-05 08:40 |\n| **报告时间** | 2025-07-05 08:57 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 核心指标解读\n\n### ✅ 白细胞系统（炎症/感染指标）—— **全部正常**\n\n| 指标 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 判断 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| 白细胞计数 (WBC) | 5.56 | 3.5–9.5 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| 中性粒细胞计数 (NE#) | 3.24 | 1.8–6.3 | ✅ |\n| 淋巴细胞计数 (LY#) | 1.95 | 1.1–3.2 | ✅ |\n| **超敏C反应蛋白 (hs-CRP)** | **0.93** | 0–6 mg/L | ✅ |\n\n> 🔔 **重点**：hs-CRP 是反映体内炎症的灵敏指标，您的结果 0.93 远低于上限 6，说明**目前没有明显的炎症或感染活动**。这与\"肠功能紊乱\"的诊断是相符的——肠功能紊乱（如肠易激综合征）通常不伴有 CRP 升高。\n\n### ✅ 红细胞系统（贫血相关）—— **全部正常**\n\n| 指标 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 判断 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| 红细胞计数 (RBC) | 4.74 | 4.3–5.8 | ✅ |\n| 血红蛋白 (HGB) | 141 | 130–175 g/L | ✅ |\n| 红细胞比积 (HCT) | 41.3% | 40–50% | ✅ |\n\n> 没有贫血，红细胞各项参数均正常。\n\n### ✅ 血小板系统（凝血相关）—— **全部正常**\n\n| 指标 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 判断 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| 血小板计数 (PLT) | 270 | 125–350 | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n## 📊 总结\n\n| 大类 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 白细胞/炎症 | 🟢 正常 |\n| 红细胞/贫血 | 🟢 正常 |\n| 血小板/凝血 | 🟢 正常 |\n| hs-CRP | 🟢 正常 |\n\n**这份报告各项指标均在正常范围内，没有发现异常。** 结合临床印象\"肠功能紊乱\"，这样的血常规结果是符合预期的——肠功能紊乱属于功能性胃肠病，通常血常规和炎症指标不会有异常改变。\n\n---\n\n> ⚠️ *以上解读仅供参考，具体诊断和治疗请以临床医生意见为准。如有腹痛加重、便血、体重下降等新症状，请及时复诊。*\n\n需要我帮您把这份报告保存为健康卡片吗？"}}, "revision": 1779347407734127, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:07.734Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:07.734Z", "client_message_id": "f44c9743-5bd7-4ec4-a81e-019b85701ab3", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "02d03aa9-c08a-4be8-90ba-0bd60b428adc", "server_message_id": "2821dd1f-15e6-476c-862f-d32be3ca5c18", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:13.607000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:14.400367+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "F9FF7956-E393-48C9-A0E0-6C028DB3ABC0", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "需要"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:13.607Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:13.607Z", "client_message_id": "02d03aa9-c08a-4be8-90ba-0bd60b428adc", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "12c04fb0-54d8-4ca2-b376-b8ad53ae96f4", "server_message_id": "f9b34e36-5297-4211-85b1-0520ca54b00d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:13.637000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:21:21.027375+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "A7450EAA-3323-5660-8D58-1F476936DC90", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779347432055770, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:32.053Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:32.056Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_rSWjWCeIdSNNy60owYll8699", "client_message_id": "12c04fb0-54d8-4ca2-b376-b8ad53ae96f4", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "A9C10736-3595-5E08-A30A-258A8D9D8E05", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_rSWjWCeIdSNNy60owYll8699"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [{"id": "94A5A1A2-02BE-4341-88CE-FB0259FEF8EE", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）检验报告单", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": true, "date_text": "2025-07-05", "member_id": 17, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"laboratory\",\"content\":\"送检项目：血细胞分析+CRP。结论：血常规及CRP各项指标均在正常参考范围内，未见明显炎症、贫血或血小板异常。\",\"date\":\"2025-07-05\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"白细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"白细胞计数(WBC)\",\"result_value\":\"5.56\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"中性粒细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"中性粒细胞计数(NE#)\",\"result_value\":\"3.24\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"淋巴细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"淋巴细胞计数(LY#)\",\"result_value\":\"1.95\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"单核细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"单核细胞计数(MO#)\",\"result_value\":\"0.34\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"嗜酸性粒细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"嗜酸性粒细胞计数(EO#)\",\"result_value\":\"0.03\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"嗜碱性粒细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"嗜碱性粒细胞计数(BA#)\",\"result_value\":\"0.00\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"红细胞计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"红细胞计数(RBC)\",\"result_value\":\"4.74\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血红蛋白\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"血红蛋白(HGB)\",\"result_value\":\"141\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"红细胞比积\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"红细胞比积(HCT)\",\"result_value\":\"41.30\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血小板计数\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"血小板计数(PLT)\",\"result_value\":\"270\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"超敏C反应蛋白\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"超敏C反应蛋白(hs-CRP)\",\"result_value\":\"0.93\",\"sort_order\":null}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"title\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）检验报告单\"}", "oss_file_id": 542}], "medical_cases": [], "prescriptions": []}}}, "revision": 1779347450665565, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:50.663Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:21:20.317Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_rSWjWCeIdSNNy60owYll8699", "parent_block_id": "A7450EAA-3323-5660-8D58-1F476936DC90", "client_message_id": "12c04fb0-54d8-4ca2-b376-b8ad53ae96f4", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_rSWjWCeIdSNNy60owYll8699"}, {"id": "183ADC58-0F1F-5124-8522-A9582F82A305", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您保存为 **检验报告** 健康卡片 ✅\n\n报告已归档，您后续可以随时在健康档案中查看这份血细胞分析+CRP的完整记录。如有其他需要，随时找我。"}}, "revision": 1779347432054574, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:32.055Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:10:32.055Z", "client_message_id": "12c04fb0-54d8-4ca2-b376-b8ad53ae96f4", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "0ade0235-7ce2-4c0e-84b7-ca678e446b14", "server_message_id": "5c0588b6-01f6-466c-8fce-d1d8ca142e22", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:28.469000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:29.234344+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "5746FC9D-1A6E-4E3D-AA82-334318F7F8FB", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "主要参数是什么"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:28.469Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:28.469Z", "client_message_id": "0ade0235-7ce2-4c0e-84b7-ca678e446b14", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "99608214-b8c3-4895-a6c3-e43823fdc566", "server_message_id": "2dce0df0-8f13-42d1-81dc-97cd6551eefd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:28.529000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:50.075349+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "40554A0D-F26E-5974-BB5D-3E7081C361AE", "kind": "deepThought", "status": "ready", "payload": {"deep_thought": {"_0": {"reasoning_content": "用户问\"主要参数是什么\"，这是在刚才生成的检验报告卡片基础上追问的。我需要从刚才的报告中提炼出关键的参数信息。\n\n让我回顾一下报告中的核心指标：\n\n1. 白细胞系统 - WBC、中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、hs-CRP\n2. 红细胞系统 - RBC、HGB、HCT\n3. 血小板 - PLT\n\n这些就是主要参数。我直接总结给用户即可。", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_duration_ms": 4147}}}, "revision": 1779348169309341, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 900, "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.286Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.309Z", "client_message_id": "99608214-b8c3-4895-a6c3-e43823fdc566", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "F5893AE3-9B16-5099-9C96-C3DFBFCFD112", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "这份报告的核心参数集中在三大系统，总结如下：\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 炎症/感染指标（白细胞系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **WBC** 白细胞计数 | 5.56 | 3.5–9.5 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **NE#** 中性粒细胞计数 | 3.24 | 1.8–6.3 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **LY#** 淋巴细胞计数 | 1.95 | 1.1–3.2 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n| **hs-CRP** 超敏C反应蛋白 | **0.93** | 0–6 mg/L | ✅ 无炎症 |\n\n---\n\n### 🟠 贫血指标（红细胞系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **RBC** 红细胞计数 | 4.74 | 4.3–5.8 ×10¹²/L | ✅ |\n| **HGB** 血红蛋白 | 141 | 130–175 g/L | ✅ |\n| **HCT** 红细胞比积 | 41.30% | 40–50% | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n### 🟡 凝血指标（血小板系统）\n\n| 参数 | 结果 | 参考范围 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **PLT** 血小板计数 | 270 | 125–350 ×10⁹/L | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n**一句话总结**：三大系统全部正常，hs-CRP 仅 0.93（极低水平），确认体内无明显炎症，与\"肠功能紊乱\"诊断一致。"}}, "revision": 1779348169288992, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "d3f18e3c-0437-4540-b7bf-f5f0a68f42e2", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.289Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:22:49.289Z", "client_message_id": "99608214-b8c3-4895-a6c3-e43823fdc566", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
