INFO 2026-05-21 10:21:43,806 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=5E9BA75A-E271-4094-ABA6-ACC3C74CB901] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=17198 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDUtMjFUMDg6MDU6MzkuNzcwMTYxKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2OTgifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "24fecfc3-3e15-42f2-b7c0-980e2a793254", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "7c0eca67-d766-4061-87b5-246640ecc9aa", "server_message_id": "2d3dacdc-4ff6-4a65-bbb8-3948bd800cc5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:19.830000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:20.575494+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "35DE1E27-4569-4D3B-9C45-29FA36777D28", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "抽取着三分报告"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "24fecfc3-3e15-42f2-b7c0-980e2a793254", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:19.830Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:19.830Z", "client_message_id": "7c0eca67-d766-4061-87b5-246640ecc9aa", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "3C8654A5-C483-4A15-B7CE-612A17269E89", "kind": "imageGallery", "status": "ready", "payload": {"image_gallery": {"_0": [{"id": "03AC1B85-505D-4BFD-91E8-4ED052089DDD", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/A896F555-C398-4408-B680-839BA7A37DD7/IMG_1991.jpeg", "text": "窗口：6号\n年龄：27岁\n2026/04/20 10:11\n药品数量/用法\n1盒\nMY25-02-04\n1盒\nMY23-01-04\n苏州大学附属第四医院\n门诊用药单\n门诊号：0000349056\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称/规格\n（MY25-02-04）普拉洛芬滴眼\n液（普南扑灵）\n5ml:5mg\n用法：滴眼 每天4次 每次1滴\n友情提示：无\n（MY25-01-04） 盐酸氮卓斯汀\n滴眼液（爱赛平）\n6ml:3ing （0.05%）\n用法：滴眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n友情提示：开启瓶封后，使用不可超过四周。", "type": "image", "file_id": 548, "file_md5": "5cd495adce333a42bb781f52c42d7f02", "full_cache_key": "a896f555-c398-4408-b680-839ba7a37dd7/IMG_1991.jpeg"}, {"id": "3CDFE733-5DDA-4F1A-A6D7-68270B4F6902", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/78979C69-DFC6-4F08-B1B7-EFAB817FDFE2/IMG_1247.png", "text": "苏州大学附属第四医院\n苏州市独墅湖医院\n胃镜诊断报告单\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n年龄：28 岁\n申请科室：消化内科门诊\n门诊号：0000349056\n住院号：\n床号：\n病区：\n检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含林醉费）\n申请单号：260821105\n①食管\n②齿状线\n③胃底\n①胃体\n⑤胃角\n6胃窦\n⑦十二指肠球部\n⑧十二指肠降部\n内镜所见：\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\n贵门：开合佳通畅；\n胃底：黏膜正常；\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\n胃角：光整；\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红为主；\n幽门：圆，开放好；\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\n诊断：\n慢性非菱缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n活检部位：\n建议：\n报告医生：健\n审核医师：F26\n报告时间：2026-02-10\n备注：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！", "type": "image", "file_id": 546, "file_md5": "b549c88052b52d02e02867117b763749", "full_cache_key": "78979c69-dfc6-4f08-b1b7-efab817fdfe2/IMG_1247.png"}, {"id": "B88DD1A8-22DE-4E89-ACF9-B88133C57208", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260521/BD2EFA07-52B0-4F7D-943F-22C8FF558F1C/%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E5%85%A8%E8%83%BD%E7%8E%8B%20%E2%81%A82025-6-4%2021.13%E2%81%A9_2.jpeg", "text": "苏州工业园区星塘医院\n放射科诊断报告书\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n年龄：27\n影像号：\nCT170867426\n科室：神经内科普通\n床号：\n检查号：441113 门诊号：\nG7207982\n检查时间：\n设备类型：CT\n报告时间：2025/6/4 15:58:21\n检查部位：颈椎椎间盘平扫，头颅平扫\n检查所见：\n头颅CT平扫示脑实质未见明显异常密度影，各脑室形态大小正常，脑沟、裂池\n未见明显异常，中线结构居中。小脑及脑干未见异常密度影。鼻咽顶后壁软组织增\n颈椎序列整齐，生理曲度平直，椎体缘可见骨质增生，椎小关节突对称，\nC4/5、C5/6椎间盘稍向后突出，相邻硬膜囊稍受压：骨性椎管无明显狭窄，椎旁软\n组织无明显肿胀。两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结。所示右侧声带相对稍厚。\n影像诊断：\n1.头颅CT平扫未见明显异常，必要时MRI检查。\n鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚，请结合专科检查。\n2.C4/5、C5/6椎间盘轻微突出；颈椎失稳：\n两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结。\n所示右侧声带相对稍厚。\n审核医生：\n天聚定\n报告医生：仿德谁，\n温馨提示：1.此报告仅提供临床参考。2.关注江苏健康通公众号，使用互联网医疗-影像报告功能，随时\n随地查询或下载影像报告。", "type": "image", "file_id": 547, "file_md5": "88e627ff89739dafbe39c6c96b3d7458", "full_cache_key": "bd2efa07-52b0-4f7d-943f-22c8ff558f1c/扫描全能王 ⁨2025-6-4 21.13⁩_2.jpeg"}]}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "24fecfc3-3e15-42f2-b7c0-980e2a793254", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:19.830Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:19.830Z", "client_message_id": "7c0eca67-d766-4061-87b5-246640ecc9aa", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "24fecfc3-3e15-42f2-b7c0-980e2a793254", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "71420aec-c420-4910-b062-60cabbb63f7b", "server_message_id": "73f0f8fc-f7b5-4487-8823-eb68508a635d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T07:59:19.896000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:05:39.770161+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "12E32621-D84F-5CE2-8748-8C5D00747087", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "根据三份报告，我为你提炼关键信息并生成对应的健康卡片：\n\n1. **门诊用药单** → 用药卡片\n2. **胃镜诊断报告** → 病历卡片\n3. **CT报告** → 检查报告卡片\n\n现在开始生成："}}, "revision": 1779350409309176, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "24fecfc3-3e15-42f2-b7c0-980e2a793254", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:00:09.309Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:00:09.309Z", "client_message_id": "71420aec-c420-4910-b062-60cabbb63f7b", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "D0BDB2E3-D70B-53A4-BB65-EF6F6C76BA9C", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "[系统] 结构化健康生成完成，不要回复任何内容。"}}}, "revision": 1779350409361238, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "24fecfc3-3e15-42f2-b7c0-980e2a793254", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:00:09.309Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:00:09.361Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_8jD4lKINGgkN2hzM1uLc7778", "client_message_id": "71420aec-c420-4910-b062-60cabbb63f7b", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "8751A281-7A21-5E7C-8C6B-A5CBA0B3D6D1", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_8jD4lKINGgkN2hzM1uLc7778"}, "stat