0.93（0-6 mg/L）\n\n所有结果均在参考区间内，无异常项。", "oss_file_id": "551", "report_type": "exam_report"}}}}, "revision": 1779351686321252, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "1606c3e1-fedf-41d2-bb23-50554df7ab4a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:21:26.281Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:21:26.321Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ZeWDx3lhxomYhG2XPMkA6019", "client_message_id": "1fddc55d-c824-4492-b8d9-56de7927487c", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "CD6D7DE5-BC2C-50B6-94AD-12317FC3D2F3", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_00_ZeWDx3lhxomYhG2XPMkA6019"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"medications": [], "exam_reports": [{"id": "ADBF3C1C-8879-4BAF-A617-EEF30E42FAFE", "title": "苏州大学附属第四医院检验报告单", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": false, "date_text": "2025-07-05", "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"laboratory\",\"content\":\"姓名：赵道凯，性别：男，年龄：26岁8月，标本：静脉全血，科别：消化内科门诊，门诊号：0000349056，临床印象：肠功能紊乱，送检项目：血细胞分析+CRP。采样时间：2025-07-05 08:40，报告时间：2025-07-05 08:57，申请医师：严海荣，检验者：钱思程，审核发布者：冯玎琦。\\n血细胞分析+CRP结果：所有结果均在参考区间内，无异常项。\",\"date\":\"2025-07-05\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"WBC白细胞计数\",\"result_value\":\"5.56\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"NE#中性粒细胞计数\",\"result_value\":\"3.24\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"LY#淋巴细胞计数\",\"result_value\":\"1.95\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"MO#单核细胞计数\",\"result_value\":\"0.34\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"EO#嗜酸性粒细胞计数\",\"result_value\":\"0.03\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血