效或解析后 start_date 晚于 end_date\n可能原因：HealthKit 不可用、未授权读取睡眠分析、该时间段没有睡眠样本、设备/模拟器没有 Apple 健康数据，或传入日期超出可查询范围。"}}}, "revision": 1779353254894426, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 4000, "thread_id": "06351be1-8921-4a37-b38a-2c8a04b27ae6", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:47:34.810Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:47:34.894Z", "tool_call_id": "call_lu7r1qxqtyl1oquqgc64fint", "client_message_id": "fec6a258-8e9d-4603-8c3d-a9dfdcaec1a0", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "EE787AD2-010F-536D-8D12-6F18C77C5A76", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "根据睡眠数据记录，您在**2026年5月19日**的睡眠情况如下：\n- 总睡眠时长：5小时51分钟\n- 睡眠结构：\n  - 深度睡眠：54分钟（占比15.5%）\n  - 核心睡眠：3小时21分钟（占比57.6%）\n  - REM睡眠：1小时36分钟（占比27.5%）\n- 清醒时长：3分钟（占比0.9%）\n\n**注**：未查询到2026年5月20日的睡眠记录，可能是该时段未佩戴设备记录或设备未同步数据。"}}, "revision": 1779353254819509, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "thread_id": "06351be1-8921-4a37-b38a-2c8a04b27ae6", "created_at": "2026-05-21T08:47:34.819Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T08:47:34.819Z", "client_message_id": "fec6a258-8e9d-4603-8c3d-a9dfdcaec1a0", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
