ate\":\"\",\"extra\":{},\"medicine_name\":\"复方双花口服液\",\"medicine_type\":\"感冒发烧\",\"notes\":\"\",\"sort_order\":\"1\",\"strength\":\"12支\\/盒\",\"total_quantity\":\"12\"}", "oss_file_id": 560, "display_name": "复方双花口服液", "specification": "12支/盒 · 口服液 · 感冒发烧"}]}}}, "revision": 1779354419125249, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "a935e537-816e-493c-8710-20a644f7efb8", "created_at": "2026-05-21T09:06:59.125Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T09:06:59.125Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_DkJSmNo35ySvezVXE40m9790", "parent_block_id": "A45F2588-B188-5E80-AA38-CAA0870475BC", "client_message_id": "25f64660-9933-41eb-a72c-6217c5376048", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_DkJSmNo35ySvezVXE40m9790"}, {"id": "E911CEBE-CB47-5701-8E62-FB2019F9F0B6", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您从图片中提取药箱信息，生成结构化卡片如下：\n\n---\n\n**📦 药箱卡片：复方双花口服液**\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **药品名称** | 复方双花口服液 |\n| **批准文号** | 国药准字 Z10940063 |\n| **规格** | 12 支/盒 |\n| **生产企业** | 北京康益药业有限公司 |\n\n---\n\n**💡 小贴士：**\n- **国药准字 Z** 开头代表这是中成药，Z10940063 表明该药于 1994 年获批。\n- 复方双花口服液常用于清热解毒、利咽消肿，适用于风热感冒、咽喉肿痛等症。\n- 建议按说明书或医嘱服用，服药期间忌辛辣、油腻食物。\n\n卡片已自动保存至您的药箱，方便后续随时查阅。如需添加更多药品或调整信息，随时"}}, "revision": 1779354426060629, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "a935e537-816e-493c-8710-20a644f7efb8", "created_at": "2026-05-21T09:07:06.061Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T09:07:06.061Z", "client_message_id": "25f64660-9933-41eb-a72c-6217c5376048", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
