您分析整理。"}}, "revision": 1779361056590468, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:36.590Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:36.590Z", "client_message_id": "b66b171c-5ef8-46de-920d-865f710e4440", "kind": "text", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "d6d8cf9a-0956-429a-ac97-417e6de003f2", "server_message_id": "7a54d7f6-ae14-4b31-9b6a-9649b4a593a2", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:44.407000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:45.154205+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "093BDBB8-8218-4ECA-A0B4-9B5441CFADDA", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "拍报告"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:44.407Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:44.407Z", "client_message_id": "d6d8cf9a-0956-429a-ac97-417e6de003f2", "kind": "text", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "d4599bf1-e558-43ff-8d4e-e5d91ec6d962", "server_message_id": "c6fe50b1-a41d-4e73-a704-89ee030f313d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:44.422000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:49.552118+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "E8C8C3EF-BA07-572E-9E6F-67515E473D93", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，请您直接**拍照上传**检查报告，我收到后会帮您仔细分析解读。\n\n拍照时注意：\n- 📱 光线充足，避免反光\n- 📄 尽量拍平整，字迹清晰\n- 🔍 关键信息（检查项目、结果、参考范围）拍清楚\n\n上传后我会帮您提炼关键指标、解读异常项，并生成可保存的健康卡片。请发过来吧！"}}, "revision": 1779361068771756, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:48.772Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:57:48.772Z", "client_message_id": "d4599bf1-e558-43ff-8d4e-e5d91ec6d962", "kind": "text", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "c49d67d4-cd72-4fb0-9f6c-90182388d4ff", "server_message_id": "c13f08f9-0ff6-4c4a-bffe-362e8105d212", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:05.335000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:06.128186+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "222F2A8B-FCA7-4CF4-BA50-83F747DA9ABC", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "拍报告"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:05.335Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:05.335Z", "client_message_id": "c49d67d4-cd72-4fb0-9f6c-90182388d4ff", "kind": "text", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "e297021b-a9cd-4ef7-8e40-10e711b38f91", "server_message_id": "941dd74c-4e91-41e6-b273-55573c6761f1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:05.353000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:12.053626+00: