.06\n10~9/L\n18 RDW\n红细胞分布宽度\n13.2\n0.0--15.0\n%\n7 NE%\n中性粒细胞百分比\n58.2\n40--75\n%\n19 *PLT\n血小板计数\n270\n125--350\n10~9/L\n8 LY%\n淋巴细胞百分比\n35.1\n20--50\n%\n20 PCT\n血小板比积\n0.240\n0.11--0.28\nMO%\n单核细胞百分比\n6.1\n3--10\n%\n21 MPV\n平均血小板体积\n8.9\n6.5--12\nfL\n10 E0%\n嗜酸性粒细胞百分比\n0.6\n0.4--8\n%\n22 PDW\n血小板分布宽度\n16.0\n≤17\n11 BA%\n嗜碱性粒细胞百分比\n0.0\n0--1\n%\n23 hs-CRP超敏C反应蛋白\n0.93\n0--6\nmg/L\n12 *RBC\n红细胞计数\n4.74\n4.3--5.8\n10~12/L.\n备注：\n检验建议：\n采样时间：\n2025-07-05 08:40\n核收时间：\n2025-07-05 08:46\n报告时间：\n2025-07-05 08:57\nCOLLECT TIME：\nRECIEVE TIME：\nREPORT TIME：\n申请医师：\nDOCTOR：_\n严海荣\nEXAMINOR：\n检验者：\n钱思程\n审核发布者：\nCHECKER：\n冯玎琦\n本报告仅对所测标本负责，如有疑问请3天内与我们联系。\n标注*的项目为江苏省检验互认项目（苏HR）。\n地址：苏州市工业园区崇文路9号2楼F区 联系电话：0512-65955310\n1/1", "type": "image", "file_id": 562, "file_md5": "346f01f2613b3bff0f75a4f18d4fe3a0", "full_cache_key": "95bace94-4db4-4cd8-88e5-75122cf8fbc4/扫描全能王 ⁨2025-7-5 09.25⁩_1-3.jpeg"}]}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:27.659Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:27.659Z", "client_message_id": "8498ee33-edb5-48f2-b3df-9f4152919eed", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "client_message_id": "efefddfd-5be8-4abb-a8ed-ffc5ab7d4b8a", "server_message_id": "f8166e2f-85fa-475d-8f31-b75a61f876b3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:27.691000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:47.292412+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "2162F330-6394-5058-8C30-495FA0E54FB1", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，已收到您上传的检查报告，我来为您解读。\n\n---\n\n## 📋 苏州大学附属第四医院 检验报告单\n\n| 基本信息 | |\n|---------|------|\n| 姓名 | 赵道凯 |\n| 性别 | 男 |\n| 年龄 | 26岁8月 |\n| 科别 | 消化内科门诊 |\n| 临床印象 | 肠功能紊乱 |\n| 送检项目 | 血细胞分析 + CRP |\n| 采样时间 | 2025-07-05 08:40 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 核心指标分析\n\n### ✅ 全部指标均在正常范围内\n\n| 类别 | 关键项目 | 结果 | 参考区间 | 判定 |\n|------|---------|------|---------|------|\n| 白细胞 | WBC 白细胞计数 | 5.56 | 3.5~9.5 | ✅ |\n| 炎症指标 | hs-CRP 超敏C反应蛋白 | 0.93 | 0~6 mg/L | ✅ |\n| 红细胞 | RBC 红细胞计数 | 4.74 | 4.3~5.8 | ✅ |\n| 血红蛋白 | HGB | 141 | 130~175 g/L | ✅ |\n| 血小板 | PLT | 270 | 125~350 | ✅ |\n| 中性粒细胞 | NE# | 3.24 | 1.8~6.3 | ✅ |\n| 淋巴细胞 | LY# | 1.95 | 1.1~3.2 | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n## 🩺 综合解读\n\n1. **血常规三系（白细胞、红细胞、血小板）均正常**，无感染、贫血或凝血异常迹象。\n2. **hs-CRP 0.93 mg/L**，远低于 6 mg/L 的上限，说明体内**无明显炎症反应**。\n3. 结合临床印象「肠功能紊乱」，本次血常规+CRP 检查结果**基本排除了感染性或明显炎症性肠病**，支持功能性肠道问题的判断。\n\n---\n\n## 💡 建议\n\n- 报告结果整体良好，无需过度担心。\n- 肠功能紊乱多为功能性，建议注意饮食规律、避免辛辣刺激、保持情绪稳定。\n- 如有持续腹痛、腹泻或体重下降等症状，建议消化内科复诊随访。\n\n---\n\n需要我把这份报告生成**可保存的健康卡片**吗？方便您随时查阅。"}}, "revision": 1779361126489586, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:46.490Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:46.490Z", "client_message_id": "efefddfd-5be8-4abb-a8ed-ffc5ab7d4b8a", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "6413e79f-b025-4af2-8309-f2d0951b8c35", "server_message_id": "4a43bbb5-082e-45bc-8515-e53a818636fe", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:51.346000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:51.952391+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "76097B39-7F50-4EFD-8A01-6FD23838DC2E", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "需要"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:58:51.346Z", "updat