"ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"exam_reports": [{"id": "1DFFE31A-7D4E-4502-AF44-B19C9B05CFEF", "title": "检验报告单", "hospital": "苏州大学附属第四医院", "is_saved": true, "date_text": "2025-07-05", "member_id": 19, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"laboratory\",\"content\":\"姓名赵道凯，男，26岁8月，科别消化内科门诊，临床印象肠功能紊乱。送检项目：血细胞分析+CRP，采样时间2025-07-05。关键结果：WBC 5.56（3.5-9.5），RBC 4.74（4.3-5.8），HGB 141（130-175），PLT 270（125-350），hs-CRP 0.93（0-6 mg\\/L）。全部指标均在正常参考区间内，无感染、贫血或明显炎症表现。\",\"date\":\"2025-07-05\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"WBC\",\"result_value\":\"5.56\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"RBC\",\"result_value\":\"4.74\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"HGB\",\"result_value\":\"141\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"PLT\",\"result_value\":\"270\",\"sort_order\":null},{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"血细胞分析+CRP\",\"diagnosis\":\"正常\",\"item_name\":\"hs-CRP\",\"result_value\":\"0.93\",\"sort_order\":null}],\"doctor\":\"\",\"hospital\":\"苏州大学附属第四医院\",\"title\":\"检验报告单\"}", "oss_file_id": 562}]}}}, "revision": 1779361153937934, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 2100, "thread_id": "547d7522-75bf-4a1c-8876-58e967fc970a", "created_at": "2026-05-21T10:59:13.929Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:03:09.369Z", "tool_call_id": "call_00_bs17Nk7ldpIHW4qqw6Y53979", "parent_block_id": "0298BCA6-90B7-5D9E-88AD-6FCE6C179D0E", "client_message_id": "341c7f6c-1a38-45a4-963a-345aa0a951d3", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_bs17Nk7ldpIHW4qqw6Y53979", "kind": "text"}, {"id": "7DF182AD-0EB5-5E8D-A8F4-5E68FB0FF502", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "已为您生成结构化健康卡片，稍后会在下方展示，方便您保存和随时查看。\n\n---\n\n## 📇 卡片概览\n\n| 项目 |