INFO 2026-05-21 11:41:34,778 chat_sync.api_io [request_id=95EEDC0F-6197-4FD3-8A3C-7E6264E05737] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MzY0Njk3LCJpYXQiOjE3NzkzNjI4OTcsImp0aSI6IjljMmYzOGExNTkyYTQwMDRhMzA2NmFjNmI4NDYyYWQ5IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjUifQ.FrYGcIYEMvgKMaQKtLu7fgLv1k1qDQYJ6JdZNrZ4zNc", "X-Request-Id": "95EEDC0F-6197-4FD3-8A3C-7E6264E05737", "Content-Length": "6524"} body={"block_updates": [{"client_message_id": "0231CBB6-710A-4BD6-9B27-13F2176A0F4D", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:59.334Z", "order_key": 1000, "node_role": "timeline", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "请你明确一下“kkbb”的具体含义哦，是有什么健康相关的问题需要咨询，还是需要调整健康报告的内容，或者有其他需求呀？"}}, "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:59.334Z", "revision": 1779363599333764, "id": "A8AE7BDC-A5F1-5289-9E37-779E4BD4DF42", "kind": "text"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "9177ADAF-CADB-48C4-8A48-4D752BD57EA5", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:07.880Z", "order_key": 1000, "node_role": "timeline", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "抱歉，我还是没理解你说的“bbkk”是什么意思呢。如果是有健康相关的疑问、需要调整之前的周报内容，或者有其他需求的话，可以把具体的内容告诉我哦，我会尽力帮你处理~"}}, "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:07.880Z", "revision": 1779363607880432, "id": "F4D99235-94D0-5AF7-94AF-F7AED28E0C38", "kind": "text"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "order_key": 9000, "node_role": "timeline", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "结合你选择的健康生活相关方向，目前收集到你的信息如下：\n- 运动习惯：每周运动≥3次，运动频率较为规律\n- 睡眠情况：日常每日睡眠时间在5-6小时（不含6小时），时长未达到健康推荐的7小时标准\n- 饮食习惯：基本每餐都会记录饮食摄入，饮食管理意识较好\n\n针对你的情况，我还有最后一个小问题哦：\n"}}, "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "revision": 1779363664623948, "id": "2438AEF0-7BFA-5E2A-AA62-24ED438C85C3", "kind": "text"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "order_key": 11000, "node_role": "timeline", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "根据你提供的信息，我为你定制了针对运动调整的健康建议：\n### 运动调整建议\n你目前每周运动≥3次，运动习惯保持得很好，结合你之前的运动记录有2次高强度羽毛球运动，且每次运动后心率恢复偏慢，给出如下建议：\n1. **强度搭配优化**：建议将每周的高强度运动（如羽毛球）控制在2次以内，其余1-2次替换为中等强度运动，比如快走、骑行、游泳等，运动时心率控制在最大心率的60%-70%（最大心率≈220-你的年龄），降低身体的整体负荷，避免长期高强度运动带来的疲劳和损伤风险。\n2. **运动前后流程完善**：每次运动前增加10-15分钟的动态热身（如高抬腿、关节环绕），运动后增加15-20分钟的静态拉伸+放松，搭配泡沫轴放松肌肉，帮助提升心率恢复速度，降低运动后酸痛感。\n3. **类型丰富度提升**：可以每周增加1次力量训练，比如自重深蹲、平板支撑、哑铃训练等，每次20-30分钟，增强肌肉力量，提升运动表现的同时也能保护关节，减少羽毛球这类跑跳运动带来的关节压力。\n\n如果你需要更具体的运动计划，也可以告诉我你的年龄、既往运动损伤史等信息，我会为你进一步调整方案~"}}, "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "revision": 1779363664625182, "id": "2438AFF0-7BFA-5FDD-AA62-25ED438C8776", "kind": "text"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "order_key": 2000, "node_role": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你希望我询问哪方面的问题？\n   已选：健康生活相关"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_4f93ddd536kve2h9ccb2hk2m", "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.670Z", "revision": 1779363664670440, "id": "F63C030A-B28F-5096-A877-C86E7C1E72C1", "kind": "tool"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "order_key": 4000, "node_role": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你目前是否有固定的每周运动习惯？\n   已选：是，每周运动≥3次"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_tvbyzmiaipqql2sqlwk77ram", "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.706Z", "revision": 1779363664706297, "id": "C3F2CEF8-2C1F-5A2C-84F7-2C50D0EE582F", "kind": "tool"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "order_key": 6000, "node_role": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你日常的每日睡眠时间大概在什么范围？\n   已选：5-6小时（不含6小时）"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_xlq6er7qtxil5z6nv8h6eiix", "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.751Z", "revision": 1779363664750832, "id": "7A03F161-893D-5CD4-A189-6565202EA02B", "kind": "tool"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "order_key": 8000, "node_role": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你是否有每日记录饮食摄入的习惯？\n   已选：是，基本每餐都会记录"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_gxiuvy8sv8y9e21ysikwnrq3", "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.791Z", "revision": 1779363664790862, "id": "2DD03393-6546-5D03-BF94-C81820CDF9EE", "kind": "tool"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}, {"client_message_id": "81179CA3-E570-4356-9DE5-6258BB3A9E3E", "block": {"created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "order_key": 10000, "node_role": "tool", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你目前最想要改善的健康问题是以下哪一项？\n   已选：调整运动强度和类型"}}}, "tool_call_id": "call_mxpvqq3meaox2s9k01p9d2dh", "status": "ready", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.831Z", "revision": 1779363664830910, "id": "302E0EA1-653A-55D4-A4A4-084F23343BDF", "kind": "tool"}, "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3"}]}
