 "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_structured_health_card", "content": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "invocation_arguments": {"raw_text": "本周（2026-05-14至2026-05-20）健康数据总结：1. 步数：总步数63476步，总距离41.67公里，其中5月18日步数仅4886步，为本周最低；2. 能量消耗：总静息能量10386.3千卡，活动能量4593.5千卡，5月14日、16日活动能量较高；3. 睡眠：仅5月17日、18日、19日有数据，5月17日总睡眠4小时37分钟，深度睡眠32分钟；5月18日总睡眠6小时38分钟，深度睡眠51分钟；5月19日总睡眠5小时51分钟，深度睡眠54分钟，REM睡眠占比在19日达到27.5%；4. 营养：无摄入记录；5. 运动：2次羽毛球运动，总时长4小时31分钟，总距离4.09公里，总活动能量2357千卡，均为高强度负荷运动。本周亮点：步数总量达标，两次高强度羽毛球运动提升活动能量消耗；风险项：睡眠数据仅覆盖3天，睡眠时长不足7小时，营养摄入无记录；最需改善：补充营养摄入，增加除睡眠数据覆盖日外的睡眠监测，确保每日睡眠时长；下周建议：保持运动频率，每日记录营养摄入，监测完整睡眠周期。", "report_type": "exam_report"}}}}, "revision": 1779362357862475, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 12000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:19:17.812Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:19:17.862Z", "tool_call_id": "call_oof0z3yi6a7xps5n1bz4z89l", "client_message_id": "86e229b2-038a-451f-ada4-142f6df18bb3", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "E025F2E4-F5B0-5C53-8601-84B9D1D14755", "kind": "structuredHealthCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_oof0z3yi6a7xps5n1bz4z89l"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {"exam_reports": [{"id": "8BFEA6C3-EEF3-4AA4-8AF7-91CB3C3723C7", "title": "健康数据总结", "is_saved": true, "date_text": "2026-05-20", "member_id": 19, "draft_json": "{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"imaging\",\"content\":\"本周（2026-05-14至2026-05-20）健康数据总结：步数总步数63476步，总距离41.67公里；能量消耗总静息能量10386.3千卡，活动能量4593.5千卡；睡眠数据覆盖5月17日、18日、19日；运动2次羽毛球运动，总时长4小时31分钟，总距离4.09公里，总活动能量2357千卡。\",\"date\":\"2026-05-20\",\"details\":[{\"attachment_file_ids\":[],\"category\":\"影像学检查\",\"diagnosis\":\"本周亮点：步数总量达标，两次高强度羽毛球运动提升活动能量消耗；风险项：睡眠数据仅覆盖3天，睡眠时长不足7小时，营养摄入无记录；最需改善：补充营养摄入，增加睡眠监测，确保每日睡眠时长；下周建议：保持运动频率，每日记录营养摄入，监测完整睡眠周期。\",\"result_value\":\"步数：总步数63476步，总距离41.67公里；能量消耗：总静息能量10386.3千卡，活动能量4593.5千卡；睡眠：5月17日总睡眠4小时37分钟，深度睡眠32分钟；5月18日总睡眠6小时38分钟，深度睡眠51分钟；5月19日总睡眠5小时51分钟，深度睡眠54分钟，REM睡眠占比27.5%；营养：无摄入记录；运动：2次羽毛球运动，总时长4小时31分钟，总距离4.09公里，总活动能量2357千卡。\",\"sort_order\":null,\"sub_category\":\"健康监测\"}],\"title\":\"健康数据总结\"}"}]}}}, "revision": 1779362362404709, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 12100, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:19:22.393Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:23:30.584Z", "tool_call_id": "call_oof0z3yi6a7xps5n1bz4z89l", "parent_block_id": "2C3445B8-172F-5025-A03A-12FA65653320", "client_message_id": "86e229b2-038a-451f-ada4-142f6df18bb3", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_oof0z3yi6a7xps5n1bz4z89l"}, {"id": "AD799F09-CB6C-5397-9B8A-16AB02277FBC", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "### 本周健康周报（2026-05-14至2026-05-20）\n#### 本周亮点\n1. 步数总量表现良好：本周累计行走63476步，总距离达41.67公里，日均步数约9068步，达到中等活动量标准。\n2. 运动强度充足：完成2次高强度羽毛球运动，总时长4小时31分钟，累计消耗活动能量2357千卡，单次运动峰值心率分别达193bpm、181bpm，有效提升心肺负荷。\n\n#### 风险项\n1. 睡眠监测不完整：仅5月17日、18日、19日有睡眠数据，其余4天睡眠数据缺失，无法完整评估本周睡眠质量。\n2. 睡眠时长不足：已监测的3天中，仅5月18日睡眠时长达到6小时38分钟，5月17日、19日睡眠时长分别为4小时37分钟、5小时51分钟，均低于健康睡眠推荐的7小时标准。\n3. 营养摄入空白：本周无任何营养摄入记录，无法评估饮食结构与能量摄入是否匹配消耗。\n\n#### 最需要改善的指标\n1. 睡眠时长与监测完整性：需补全本周剩余4天的睡眠数据，且每日睡眠时长应稳定达到7小时以上。\n2. 营养摄入：建立每日饮食记录，确保蛋白质、碳水化合物、脂肪等营养素的合理摄入，匹配每日能量消耗。\n\n#### 下周建议\n1. 睡眠管理：每日固定22:00前入睡，保证7小时连续睡眠，使用睡眠监测工具记录完整周期，重点关注深度睡眠占比（目标≥20%）。\n2. 饮食调整：每日记录早、中、晚三餐的营养摄入，保证蛋白质（1.2-1.6g/kg体重）、膳食纤维的摄入，减少高糖高脂食物。\n3. 运动延续：保持每周2-3次中等强度运动，可适当增加1次步行或骑行运动，替代部分高强度运动以降低身体负荷。\n\n（结构化健康卡片已后台生成，可在健康记录中查看）"}}, "revision": 1779362357813477, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 13000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:19:17.813Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:19:17.813Z", "client_message_id": "86e229b2-038a-451f-ada4-142f6df18bb3", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "e9369c51-724b-4e9a-abab-e9cae2580768", "server_message_id": "576bf1fe-b0ed-4586-838e-b823bf4612c3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:56.771000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:34.466576+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "F802BE8E-A527-44BB-8A0A-78CAC6C8A1C9", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "kkbb"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:56.771Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:56.771Z", "client_message_id": "e9369c51-724b-4e9a-abab-e9cae2580768", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-mini-260428", "client_message_id": "0231cbb6-710a-4bd6-9b27-13f2176a0f4d", "server_message_id": "24140845-eee5-48ce-9be1-bebadb80499b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:56.805000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:35.797186+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "A8AE7BDC-A5F1-5289-9E37-779E4BD4DF42", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "请你明确一下“kkbb”的具体含义哦，是有什么健康相关的问题需要咨询，还是需要调整健康报告的内容，或者有其他需求呀？"}}, "revision": 1779363599333764, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:59.334Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:39:59.334Z", "client_message_id": "0231cbb6-710a-4bd6-9b27-13f2176a0f4d", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "ebf78ac6-3cf4-4469-8fa2-e61f6afaa78c", "server_message_id": "c58ada17-0cb4-4b88-a2b1-a5513cd1d51e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:04.726000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:35.807886+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "5703F10B-3342-46A7-8E4E-35DA6AF9DD25", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "bbkk"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:04.726Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:04.726Z", "client_message_id": "ebf78ac6-3cf4-4469-8fa2-e61f6afaa78c", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "9177adaf-cadb-48c4-8a48-4d752bd57ea5", "server_message_id": "6544f708-ba21-4c2b-96bc-8096fecd0928", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:04.758000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:35.818506+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "F4D99235-94D0-5AF7-94AF-F7AED28E0C38", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "抱歉，我还是没理解你说的“bbkk”是什么意思呢。如果是有健康相关的疑问、需要调整之前的周报内容，或者有其他需求的话，可以把具体的内容告诉我哦，我会尽力帮你处理~"}}, "revision": 1779363607880432, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 1000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:07.880Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:07.880Z", "client_message_id": "9177adaf-cadb-48c4-8a48-4d752bd57ea5", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "6751579f-1595-4231-b2d8-9a0edbb30ffe", "server_message_id": "2c0d3d57-8d02-4e42-80bd-9f0f9f1c8e66", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:16.364000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:35.830739+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "0FE29976-FD02-4246-99DA-8A86B294DAE5", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "提问我"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:16.364Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:16.364Z", "client_message_id": "6751579f-1595-4231-b2d8-9a0edbb30ffe", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "server_message_id": "d3df06e5-e60f-4467-84bf-a8add15099d5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:40:16.396000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:35.839929+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "F63C030A-B28F-5096-A877-C86E7C1E72C1", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你希望我询问哪方面的问题？\n   已选：健康生活相关"}}}, "revision": 1779363664670440, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.670Z", "tool_call_id": "call_4f93ddd536kve2h9ccb2hk2m", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "C3F2CEF8-2C1F-5A2C-84F7-2C50D0EE582F", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你目前是否有固定的每周运动习惯？\n   已选：是，每周运动≥3次"}}}, "revision": 1779363664706297, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 4000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.706Z", "tool_call_id": "call_tvbyzmiaipqql2sqlwk77ram", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "7A03F161-893D-5CD4-A189-6565202EA02B", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你日常的每日睡眠时间大概在什么范围？\n   已选：5-6小时（不含6小时）"}}}, "revision": 1779363664750832, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 6000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.751Z", "tool_call_id": "call_xlq6er7qtxil5z6nv8h6eiix", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "2DD03393-6546-5D03-BF94-C81820CDF9EE", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你是否有每日记录饮食摄入的习惯？\n   已选：是，基本每餐都会记录"}}}, "revision": 1779363664790862, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 8000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.791Z", "tool_call_id": "call_gxiuvy8sv8y9e21ysikwnrq3", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "2438AEF0-7BFA-5E2A-AA62-24ED438C85C3", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "结合你选择的健康生活相关方向，目前收集到你的信息如下：\n- 运动习惯：每周运动≥3次，运动频率较为规律\n- 睡眠情况：日常每日睡眠时间在5-6小时（不含6小时），时长未达到健康推荐的7小时标准\n- 饮食习惯：基本每餐都会记录饮食摄入，饮食管理意识较好\n\n针对你的情况，我还有最后一个小问题哦：\n"}}, "revision": 1779363664623948, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 9000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "302E0EA1-653A-55D4-A4A4-084F23343BDF", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "ask_user_question", "content": "用户已提交选择：\n1. 你目前最想要改善的健康问题是以下哪一项？\n   已选：调整运动强度和类型"}}}, "revision": 1779363664830910, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 10000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.622Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.831Z", "tool_call_id": "call_mxpvqq3meaox2s9k01p9d2dh", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "2438AFF0-7BFA-5FDD-AA62-25ED438C8776", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "根据你提供的信息，我为你定制了针对运动调整的健康建议：\n### 运动调整建议\n你目前每周运动≥3次，运动习惯保持得很好，结合你之前的运动记录有2次高强度羽毛球运动，且每次运动后心率恢复偏慢，给出如下建议：\n1. **强度搭配优化**：建议将每周的高强度运动（如羽毛球）控制在2次以内，其余1-2次替换为中等强度运动，比如快走、骑行、游泳等，运动时心率控制在最大心率的60%-70%（最大心率≈220-你的年龄），降低身体的整体负荷，避免长期高强度运动带来的疲劳和损伤风险。\n2. **运动前后流程完善**：每次运动前增加10-15分钟的动态热身（如高抬腿、关节环绕），运动后增加15-20分钟的静态拉伸+放松，搭配泡沫轴放松肌肉，帮助提升心率恢复速度，降低运动后酸痛感。\n3. **类型丰富度提升**：可以每周增加1次力量训练，比如自重深蹲、平板支撑、哑铃训练等，每次20-30分钟，增强肌肉力量，提升运动表现的同时也能保护关节，减少羽毛球这类跑跳运动带来的关节压力。\n\n如果你需要更具体的运动计划，也可以告诉我你的年龄、既往运动损伤史等信息，我会为你进一步调整方案~"}}, "revision": 1779363664625182, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 11000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:04.624Z", "client_message_id": "81179ca3-e570-4356-9de5-6258bb3a9e3e", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "b28ccc89-6378-4538-a2a6-938e2fad15f3", "server_message_id": "26ff3255-e716-4713-b82f-b300fdfb1f31", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:12.930000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:35.865473+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "9C1F03F7-5539-4684-9FD9-8650DE7F4B40", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "创建任务"}}, "revision": 1, "node_role": "timeline", "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:12.930Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:12.930Z", "client_message_id": "b28ccc89-6378-4538-a2a6-938e2fad15f3", "order_key": null, "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "role": "assistant", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "client_message_id": "e5a2651b-6cff-4b01-ba62-f7b7bf5de7ac", "server_message_id": "4971daf1-8695-474b-a9e1-574522b9e316", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:12.971000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:42:09.855828+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "AD0041B8-C72A-57F5-B8D9-9E7C55ABB710", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "query_tasks_by_member", "content": "已查询成员 19 的任务。\n查询时间：2026-05-21T11:41:34.710Z\n任务数量：0\n当前没有可用于对比的任务。"}}}, "revision": 1779363713464714, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:53.462Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:53.465Z", "tool_call_id": "call_oyox4r4jqgdx4e2dygjc01ip", "client_message_id": "e5a2651b-6cff-4b01-ba62-f7b7bf5de7ac", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "279E70D8-A469-5B49-83EC-24C69C975738", "kind": "tool", "status": "ready", "payload": {"tool": {"_0": {"name": "generate_task", "content": "已根据描述生成 1 条待确认任务「心率、运动次数、运动时长」。请在消息内任务卡片中确认或忽略。"}}}, "revision": 1779363713505606, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 4000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:53.462Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:53.506Z", "tool_call_id": "call_brua0i3qgadar8dyxf2yq1sr", "client_message_id": "e5a2651b-6cff-4b01-ba62-f7b7bf5de7ac", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "860BDDBA-7B16-53CF-B43D-DB6A1CAC8E91", "kind": "taskCards", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_brua0i3qgadar8dyxf2yq1sr"}, "status": "ready", "payload": {"task_cards": {"_0": [{"id": -1779363708, "type": 1, "title": "心率、运动次数、运动时长", "member": 19, "source": 1, "status": 1, "due_time": "2026-05-28T11:41:48.414Z", "priority": 1, "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:48.414Z", "start_time": "2026-05-21T11:41:48.414Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:42:09.236Z", "business_id": "", "description": "目标：心率、运动次数、运动时长\n动作：打羽毛球、快走、骑行、游泳、动态热身、静态拉伸、泡沫轴放松、力量训练（自重深蹲、平板支撑、哑铃训练等）\n计划：每周高强度羽毛球运动不超过2次、每周增加1次力量训练、每次运动前后\n强度：高强度、中等强度、心率为最大心率的60%-70%、热身10-15分钟、静态拉伸+泡沫轴放松15-20分钟、力量训练20-30分钟", "repeat_type": 2, "task_payload": {"task": "{\"creator_id\":\"current_user\",\"due_time\":\"2026-05-28T11:41:48.414Z\",\"member\":19,\"member_id\":19,\"priority\":1,\"repeat_type\":2,\"source\":1,\"start_time\":\"2026-05-21T11:41:48.414Z\",\"status\":0,\"type\":1}", "task_exercise": "{\"exercise_type\":\"打羽毛球、快走、骑行、游泳、动态热身、静态拉伸、泡沫轴放松、力量训练（自重深蹲、平板支撑、哑铃训练等）\",\"description\":\"心率、运动次数、运动时长\",\"duration_min\":60,\"intensity\":\"medium\"}"}, "business_type": "ai_task_generation", "ignored_reason": "", "extract_payload": {"action": "打羽毛球、快走、骑行、游泳、动态热身、静态拉伸、泡沫轴放松、力量训练（自重深蹲、平板支撑、哑铃训练等）", "period": "weekly", "frequency": "每周高强度羽毛球运动不超过2次、每周增加1次力量训练、每次运动前后", "task_type": "exercise", "confidence": "1.00", "start_time": "", "target_metric": "心率、运动次数、运动时长", "intensity_or_value": "高强度、中等强度、心率为最大心率的60%-70%、热身10-15分钟、静态拉伸+泡沫轴放松15-20分钟、力量训练20-30分钟"}, "similarity_payload": {"member_source": "thread_member_binding", "queried_first": "true", "similar_count": "0"}}]}}, "revision": 1779363708424133, "node_role": "toolPresentation", "order_key": 4100, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:48.424Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:42:09.236Z", "tool_call_id": "call_brua0i3qgadar8dyxf2yq1sr", "client_message_id": "e5a2651b-6cff-4b01-ba62-f7b7bf5de7ac", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null}, {"id": "C4C2BF73-5B54-5F07-BC03-07386653CF6C", "kind": "text", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "我已经根据你选择的运动调整需求生成了对应的待确认任务卡片，你可以在下方的卡片中查看任务详情，确认后即可同步到你的待办列表中哦 ✅\n\n任务内容包含：\n1. 每周高强度羽毛球运动≤2次，其余运动替换为中等强度有氧运动\n2. 每次运动前后完成规范的热身+放松流程\n3. 每周新增1次力量训练\n"}}, "revision": 1779363713463716, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 5000, "thread_id": "c716aff2-6891-4fe7-95d4-ee7649898bf3", "created_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:53.464Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T11:41:53.464Z", "client_message_id": "e5a2651b-6cff-4b01-ba62-f7b7bf5de7ac", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
