-182）。血脂：TG 0.10mmol/L（<1.70），TC 5.07mmol/L（<5.18），HDL-C 1.51mmol/L（>1.04），LDL-C 3.51mmol/L（<3.40偏高）。", "report_type": "exam_report"}}}}, "revision": 1779365538813645, "status": "ready", "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:12:18.814Z"}, {"created_at": "2026-05-21T12:12:18.813Z", "id": "8B8AF593-C9A5-5A86-B9A7-627E1C1F8C77", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "好的，检验报告已按纯数据结构化保存，不附加解读。卡片正在后台生成，稍后可在健康记录中查看。"}}, "revision": 1779365538813086, "status": "ready", "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:12:18.813Z"}], "thread_id": "C716AFF2-6891-4FE7-95D4-EE7649898BF3", "delivery_state": "sending", "thread_current_model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_max_messages": 20}]}
