可用、未授权读取睡眠分析、该时间段没有睡眠样本、设备/模拟器没有 Apple 健康数据，或传入日期超出可查询范围。"}}}, "revision": 1779366160661802, "node_role": "tool", "order_key": 2000, "thread_id": "1a899c75-1f9b-44b5-9703-bb7c81736e08", "created_at": "2026-05-21T12:22:40.622Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:22:40.662Z", "tool_call_id": "call_xmuertile6zlr82azhu8vxer", "client_message_id": "16ec9c32-ce85-414d-be99-106ca23925ca", "kind": "text", "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}, {"id": "AA78BDD4-C79D-5616-ADF8-F271472C1113", "status": "ready", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "我暂时没有查询到你最近的睡眠记录哦，可能是你还没有授权读取睡眠数据，或者近期没有同步过睡眠相关的设备数据。你可以先检查下健康权限的授权状态，或者补充同步睡眠记录后，我再帮你分析~"}}, "revision": 1779366160660682, "node_role": "timeline", "order_key": 3000, "thread_id": "1a899c75-1f9b-44b5-9703-bb7c81736e08", "created_at": "2026-05-21T12:22:40.661Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:22:40.661Z", "client_message_id": "16ec9c32-ce85-414d-be99-106ca23925ca", "kind": "text", "tool_call_id": null, "parent_tool_call_id": null, "parent_block_id": null, "anchor": null}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
