"05:40", "end": 1779313344, "start_percent": 86.27697172619048}, {"stage": "rem", "end_text": "05:48", "start": 1779313344, "width_percent": 1.8229166666666667, "start_text": "05:42", "end": 1779313736, "start_percent": 86.83500744047619}, {"stage": "core", "end_text": "06:19", "start": 1779313736, "width_percent": 8.403087797619047, "start_text": "05:48", "end": 1779315543, "vitals": {"min_heart_rate": 52, "avg_respiratory_rate": 13.5, "max_heart_rate": 55, "avg_heart_rate": 53.57142857142857}, "start_percent": 88.65792410714286}, {"stage": "rem", "end_text": "06:29", "start": 1779315543, "width_percent": 2.9389880952380953, "start_text": "06:19", "end": 1779316175, "vitals": {"avg_respiratory_rate": 16.25}, "start_percent": 97.06101190476191}], "date": "2026-05-20", "stages": {"core": 223, "deep": 48, "rem": 83, "unspecified": 0, "awake": 7}, "summary": {"total_sleep_minutes": 354, "end_text": "06:29", "start": 1779294671, "end": 1779316175, "start_text": "00:31"}}], "schema_version": "health_sleep_v1"}}}, "id": "A8578942-3CFB-5FA7-B883-E6B0AF05241A", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_04s83copbnzvjwebqtimrnkj"}, "tool_call_id": "call_04s83copbnzvjwebqtimrnkj", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_04s83copbnzvjwebqtimrnkj", "status": "ready", "revision": 1779366240846844, "order_key": 2100, "created_at": "2026-05-21T12:24:00.847Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:24:00.847Z", "node_role": "toolPresentation"}, {"status": "ready", "revision": 1779366251463868, "id": "02B2C6DB-1604-541E-B56B-9E95AAAF4CAF", "order_key": 3000, "payload": {"text": {"_0": "这是你近7天（5.17-5.20）的睡眠记录汇总：\n### 整体睡眠概况\n| 日期 | 总睡眠时长 | 清醒占比 | REM占比 | 核心睡眠占比 | 深度睡眠占比 |\n|------|------------|----------|---------|--------------|--------------|\n| 5.17 | 4小时28分钟 | 4.3% | 21.3% | 63.8% | 11.5% |\n| 5.18 | 6小时38分钟 | 2.5% | 8.7% | 29.1% | 6.8% |\n| 5.19 | 5小时51分钟 | 0.9% | 27.5% | 57.6% | 15.5% |\n| 5.20 | 5小时54分钟 | 2.0% | 23.2% | 62.2% | 13.4% |\n\n### 特点说明\n1. 睡眠时长波动较大，5.17仅4.5小时左右，其余天数在5.5-6.5小时区间，尚未达到成年人推荐的7-8小时睡眠时长；\n2. 睡眠连续性整体较好，清醒占比普遍低于5%，夜间很少频繁醒来；\n3. 深度睡眠占比略偏低，仅5.19达到15%的推荐阈值，其余天数均低于15%，可能会影响身体疲劳恢复效率；\n4. REM睡眠占比整体充足，5.19、5.20均超过20%，有助于认知和记忆巩固。\n\n如果需要调整睡眠方案，可以告诉我你的作息习惯，我可以帮你制定针对性的改善"}}, "created_at": "2026-05-21T12:24:11.464Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:24:11.464Z", "node_role": "timeline"}], "created_at": "2026-05-21T12:23:57.136Z", "thread_temperature": 0.6, "thread_max_tokens": 14096, "thread_id": "1A899C75-1F9B-44B5-9703-BB7C81736E08", "model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215", "thread_top_p": 1, "delivery_state": "sending", "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-21T12:24:11.655Z", "thread_current_model_name": "doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215"}]}
