10:48，检验机构：苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）。\n\n生化检验结果：\n总胆红素IBIL 13.5μmol/L（≤26），直接胆红素DBIL 4.2μmol/L（≤8），间接胆红素IBIL 9.3μmol/L，天门冬氨酸氨基转移酶AST 13.5U/L，丙氨酸氨基转移酶ALT 14.6U/L，总蛋白TP 77.0g/L，白蛋白ALB 47.4g/L（40-），球蛋白GLOB 29.6g/L，白球比A/G 1.6，γ-谷氨酰转肽酶GGT 19.9U/L，碱性磷酸酶ALP 75.9U/L，前白蛋白PA 287.0mg/L，尿素UREA 5.14mmol/L，肌酐CREA 77.50μmol/L，尿酸UA 324.6μmol/L，胱抑素C CysC 0.76mg/L，空腹血糖GLU 5.42mmol/L，肌酸激酶CK 104.3U/L，乳酸脱氢酶LDH 168.0U/L（120-250），α-羟丁酸脱氢酶HBDH 140.4U/L（72-182），胆碱酯酶CHE 11124U/L。\n\n血脂：甘油三酯TG 0.70mmol/L（适宜＜1.70），总胆固醇TC 5.07mmol/L（适宜＜5.18），高密度脂蛋白胆固醇HDL-C 1.51mmol/L（＞1.04），低密度脂蛋白胆固醇LDL-C 3.51mmol/L（适宜＜3.40，边缘升高）。", "oss_file_id": "572", "report_type": "exam_report"}}}}}, {"payload": {"structured_health_cards": {"_0": {}}}, "created_at": "2026-05-21T16:00:23.271Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T16:00:23.271Z", "parent_tool_call_id": "call_00_HFkUNucOqs2nAg7BqXQv9441", "tool_call_id": "call_00_HFkUNucOqs2nAg7BqXQv9441", "parent_block_id": "0875304E-BEDC-5AA0-8EF4-58609FE4C534", "order_key": 2100, "status": "pending", "id": "69B3F2A3-B5A5-5FC8-89CA-4A1F4D1E0AA9", "anchor": {"value": "call_00_HFkUNucOqs2nAg7BqXQv9441", "type": "toolCall"}, "revision": 1779379223270900, "node_role": "toolPresentation"}, {"node_role": "timeline", "created_at": "2026-05-21T16:00:24.843Z", "order_key": 3000, "status": "ready", "id": "275011FE-97EC-53FF-8B95-F96737B5AF84", "revision": 1779379224842800, "updated_at": "2026-05-21T16:00:24.843Z", "payload": {"text": {"_0": "报告卡片已生成，如下所示："}}}]}]}
